<!doctype lake><title>Generative Models IV</title><meta name="reading-minutes" content="39"><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="rjvzt" id="rjvzt"><span data-lake-id="u07325f70" id="u07325f70">🐎</span><span data-lake-id="u167924c6" id="u167924c6"> 𝐄𝐥𝐮𝐜𝐢𝐝𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧 𝐒𝐩𝐚𝐜𝐞 𝐨𝐟 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐮𝐬𝐢𝐨𝐧-𝐁𝐚𝐬𝐞𝐝 𝐆𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u390e4712" id="u390e4712"><span data-lake-id="u2103b298" id="u2103b298">如何进一步改进扩散模型，使其在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c5e996c" id="u1c5e996c">图像质量、分布拟合质量、训练成本</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc3500543" id="uc3500543">以及</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8f9e040a" id="u8f9e040a">生成速度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud0eda171" id="ud0eda171">等方面取得更优表现，已成为当前研究中的核心问题。现有关于扩散模型的文献在理论层面极为密集，其关于采样日程、训练动力学、噪声水平参数化等内容的推导，通常都尽可能直接地建立在严密的理论框架之上。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u11dc22ca" id="u11dc22ca" style="color: #DF2A3F">这种做法固然保证模型具有扎实的理论基础，但也可能带来一个问题：模型的可设计空间被遮蔽</span></strong></p><ul list="u057e8d4e"><li fid="u37f40dd8" data-lake-id="ua13fffbc" id="ua13fffbc"><span data-lake-id="u52ad66f3" id="u52ad66f3">论文从实践而非纯理论视角重新审视这类模型，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u22dfae24" id="u22dfae24" style="color: #2A4200">重点关注训练与采样阶段中实际可操作的对象和算法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8f9a4a48" id="u8f9a4a48">，而非过度依赖其背后的统计过程推导。其目的在于更清晰地揭示各组件之间的关系，并识别整体系统中的设计自由度。论文聚焦于这样一类模型：它们利用神经网络刻画训练数据在加入高斯噪声后、随噪声水平变化的边缘分布的 score，因此全文讨论均建立在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u06d2f600" id="u06d2f600">去噪 score matching </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2fa3919e" id="u2fa3919e">框架之上</span></li><li fid="u37f40dd8" data-lake-id="uf7078d03" id="uf7078d03"><span data-lake-id="ub09d3dce" id="ub09d3dce">论文围绕扩散模型的图像采样过程展开研究，识别效果最优的时间离散化方式，将高阶 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7385389f" id="u7385389f">Runge–Kutta</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u90a1fa9b" id="u90a1fa9b"> 方法引入采样，评估不同采样调度策略，并分析采样中随机性的作用。这些改进显著减少图像生成所需的采样步数，且改进后的采样器可作为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6b78b2e" id="ub6b78b2e">即插即用</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7f67eef0" id="u7f67eef0">模块，直接应用于多种已有扩散模型</span></li><li fid="u37f40dd8" data-lake-id="u6b8786a5" id="u6b8786a5"><span data-lake-id="u82fef89c" id="u82fef89c">论文关注 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ee3d79c" id="u5ee3d79c">score</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0b3a8f8e" id="u0b3a8f8e"> 网络的训练机制。在仍采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u337ef9c4" id="u337ef9c4">DDPM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2327c25b" id="u2327c25b">、</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5c3bac32" id="u5c3bac32">NCSN</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u18a4f2ad" id="u18a4f2ad"> 等常用架构的基础上，首次从原则层面对扩散模型中网络输入、输出及损失函数的预条件化进行系统分析，并总结出改善训练动态的最佳实践</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="K3fRN" id="K3fRN"><span data-lake-id="u3a92df31" id="u3a92df31">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u733f04f5" id="u733f04f5"> 𝑬𝒙𝒑𝒓𝒆𝒔𝒔𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒅𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝒎𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒊𝒏 𝒂 𝒄𝒐𝒎𝒎𝒐𝒏 𝒇𝒓𝒂𝒎𝒆𝒘𝒐𝒓𝒌</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ueba4879e" id="ueba4879e"><span data-lake-id="u8577fa44" id="u8577fa44">设数据分布为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FykqJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc05d6273" id="uc05d6273">，其标准差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ETGDY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub19d8bf4" id="ub19d8bf4">。进一步考虑一族经平滑化后的分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JY1IL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7d1ee615" id="u7d1ee615">，其构造方式为向原始数据中加入标准差为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tQB6R%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5601290e" id="u5601290e">的独立同分布高斯噪声。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22i3M2w%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%20%5C%5Cgg%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u809a1784" id="u809a1784">时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OrVkZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9c268fe1" id="u9c268fe1">在实际中几乎无法与纯高斯噪声区分。扩散模型的基本思想是首先随机采样一个噪声图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uPnaZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E2%20I)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0244f25f" id="u0244f25f">，随后按照噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lhPUs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_0%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%20%3E%20%5C%5Csigma_1%20%3E%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%3E%20%5C%5Csigma_N%20%3D%200%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf8513646" id="uf8513646">逐步对其进行去噪，得到一系列图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tetpz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uca4cade0" id="uca4cade0">，并使得在每一个噪声水平下均满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BlOW1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_i%20%5C%5Csim%20p(x_i%3B%5C%5Csigma_i)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf254267b" id="uf254267b">。因此，该过程的终点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IXhjd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48dfe754" id="u48dfe754">便服从真实数据分布</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue9745f61" id="ue9745f61"><span data-lake-id="ue38893db" id="ue38893db">Song 提出一种随机微分方程（SDE），用于刻画样本的时间演化过程，保证样本在各时刻均符合相应噪声水平下的边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22niQ5b%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma(t))%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40a3ac68" id="u40a3ac68">。这使得上述过程可以通过一种随机求解器来实现，其在每一步迭代中既会去除噪声，也会重新注入噪声。与此同时，还可构造与之对应的概率流常微分方程（ODE），其中唯一的随机性来源于初始噪声图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XcPzl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2f5288e1" id="u2f5288e1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u591d6270" id="u591d6270">概率流 ODE 在时间正向推进时连续增加图像中的噪声水平，而在时间反向推进时则连续降低噪声水平。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u99c9a7ea" id="u99c9a7ea">为明确该 ODE 的具体形式，首先需要给定一个噪声调度函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ilqjg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2af86820" id="u2af86820">，用于定义时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22K0MU4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b58b83d" id="u8b58b83d">所对应的目标噪声水平</span><span data-lake-id="ub852dcb3" id="ub852dcb3"></span>。<span fid="u35afc176" data-lake-id="u670793c8" id="u670793c8"><span data-lake-id="u40cbaf59" id="u40cbaf59">概率流 ODE 保持各噪声水平对应的边缘分布：若样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qZG5Q%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_a%20%5C%5Csim%20p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma(t_a))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud2e8c909" id="ud2e8c909">从时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dgDYL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_a%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf1a46e5" id="ubf1a46e5">演化至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ugqfe%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8346f694" id="u8346f694">（正向或反向），则有</span><span data-lake-id="ud91b94f8" id="ud91b94f8"></span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Lg3op%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_b%20%5C%5Csim%20p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma(t_b))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucff137c5" id="ucff137c5"></span></span></p><p data-lake-id="u065d27d4" id="u065d27d4" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="1"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WAQP0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma(t))%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-1">(1)</span></p><ul list="u8ad1e4e0"><li fid="ub560592a" data-lake-id="u659a7618" id="u659a7618"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EofLH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_x%20%5C%5Clog%20p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf2fee48" id="ucf2fee48">即为 score function，它是一个向量场，在给定噪声水平下指向数据密度更高的方向。直观而言，该 ODE 的一个无穷小正向步会将样本从数据分布附近进一步推离，其速率取决于噪声水平的变化；等价地，一个反向步则会将样本推向数据分布</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uba32159b" id="uba32159b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9eb68cf8" id="u9eb68cf8">去噪 score matching：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u81111ad4" id="u81111ad4">score function 具有一个重要性质，即它不依赖于底层密度函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xQ8e4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6636f9a" id="ua6636f9a">那个通常难以计算的归一化常数，因而更易于求值。若</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vWav5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3c620158" id="u3c620158">表示一个去噪函数，并且对于每个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vPjzv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9117c14e" id="u9117c14e">都最小化如下期望</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Lx9jE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a303308" id="u3a303308">去噪误差</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6de152d2" id="u6de152d2" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="2"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22L3nMY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%7C%20D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20then%20%7D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma)%20%3D%20(D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D)%20%2F%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-2">(2)</span></p><ul list="u10c6dd34"><li fid="u0d6e8631" data-lake-id="ud4d66802" id="ud4d66802"><span data-lake-id="u17b02099" id="u17b02099">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22U9YCX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefd91b70" id="uefd91b70">为训练图像，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lLR4X%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u187ff6b7" id="u187ff6b7">为噪声。从这一角度看，score function 实际上刻画样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BOnqJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0756b71" id="ub0756b71">中噪声成分相对于信号成分的分离方式。扩散模型的关键观察在于，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Hap5b%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u84aa3c48" id="u84aa3c48">可以由神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HVjc1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd3bd45b" id="udd3bd45b">来实现并进行训练。需要注意的是，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22N5Hm6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e2130f7" id="u4e2130f7">中还可能包含额外的预处理与后处理步骤</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u10212597" id="u10212597"><strong><span data-lake-id="u73c1d7e4" id="u73c1d7e4">信号缩放调度通过改变概率密度影响 ODE 解轨迹。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u11870c64" id="u11870c64">某些方法引入额外的缩放调度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hpnbq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1d92313" id="ud1d92313">。这会改变随时间变化的概率密度，从而也会改变 ODE 的解轨迹</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9765bee4" id="u9765bee4" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="3"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22f6u08%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bs(t)%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Ds(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%20-%20s(t)%5E2%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%7Bs(t)%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-3">(3)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u137f0923" id="u137f0923"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c803c99" id="u3c803c99">数值积分通过离散时间步近似求解生成轨迹。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u106a0a58" id="u106a0a58">ODE 的解可通过数值积分获得，即在离散时间区间上进行有限步推进。这一过程既需要选择积分方案，例如 Euler 方法或某种 Runge–Kutta 变体，也需要确定离散采样时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BMd4p%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_0%2Ct_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Ct_N%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub605bb67" id="ub605bb67">。许多已有工作采用 Euler 方法，但论文表明二阶求解器在计算代价与性能之间提供更优折中</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="ufiWu" id="ufiWu"><span data-lake-id="u86ccc294" id="u86ccc294">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="uae30fca5" id="uae30fca5"> 𝑰𝒎𝒑𝒓𝒐𝒗𝒆𝒎𝒆𝒏𝒕𝒔 𝒕𝒐 𝒅𝒆𝒕𝒆𝒓𝒎𝒊𝒏𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒄 𝒔𝒂𝒎𝒑𝒍𝒊𝒏𝒈</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u85046da6" id="u85046da6"><span data-lake-id="u87065925" id="u87065925">作者提出的基本假设是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u96cbf3b4" id="u96cbf3b4">与采样过程相关的设计选择，在很大程度上独立于其他组件</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udbaa2fcc" id="udbaa2fcc">，例如网络结构和训练细节。换言之，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mehvQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5df7e314" id="u5df7e314">的训练方式不应决定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SeSoo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u29dd5682" id="u29dd5682">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bDxQx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5457a76e" id="u5457a76e">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22g7QWj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ea79c77" id="u0ea79c77">的选取，反之亦然；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3af90689" id="u3af90689" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">从采样器的角度看，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vsmbP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8b9fae4" id="ud8b9fae4" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">只是一个黑箱 </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u4caee589" id="u4caee589"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9427c074" id="u9427c074">离散化与高阶积分器：对 ODE 的数值求解本质上是对真实解轨迹的近似。求解器在每一步都会引入截断误差，而这一误差会在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GKNHd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udc7450c8" id="udc7450c8">个步骤中不断累积。一般而言，局部误差相对于步长呈超线性缩放，因此增大</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZyJsX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud5481dd0" id="ud5481dd0">通常能够提升解的精度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u88a0b227" id="u88a0b227"><span data-lake-id="uea70a912" id="uea70a912">常用的 Euler 方法是一阶 ODE 求解器，其局部误差相对于步长</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22c32Tr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22h%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18e12bdf" id="u18e12bdf">为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mm2vu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(h%5E2)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u390b8b9b" id="u390b8b9b">。更高阶的 Runge–Kutta 方法在误差缩放方面更有优势，但每一步需要多次评估</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KWRN4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6560da4" id="ue6560da4">。通过大量实验，作者发现 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u320d86cb" id="u320d86cb">Heun 二阶方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u13770c17" id="u13770c17">（亦称改进 Euler 法或梯形法）在截断误差与 NFE 之间提供极佳的折中；正如算法 1 所示，该方法在计算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XiR9I%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79cdb991" id="u79cdb991">时引入额外的校正步骤，以补偿</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gwSo5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc3aade9b" id="uc3aade9b">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Swstk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bi%2B1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued152a65" id="ued152a65">之间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22v4Gsq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx%2Fdt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3f63b776" id="u3f63b776">的变化。这一步校正以每步额外一次</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DWFP8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5cd5ee3b" id="u5cd5ee3b">评估为代价，将局部误差降低到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IxSiu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(h%5E3)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u239ccb87" id="u239ccb87">。需要指出的是，当步进到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ipKv5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7b29300" id="ub7b29300">时会导致除零问题，因此在该特殊情况下作者退回使用 Euler 方法</span></p><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="edm-algorithm-1">
<figcaption id="edm-algorithm-1"><strong>Algorithm 1</strong> Deterministic Sampling Using Heun’s Second-Order Method</figcaption>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{r l}
1:&amp;\textbf{procedure }\operatorname{HeunSampler}\!\left(D_\theta(x;\sigma),\,\sigma(t),\,s(t),\,t_{i\in\{0,\ldots,N\}}\right)\\[-0.2em]
2:&amp;\quad\textbf{sample }\mathbf{x}_0\sim\mathcal N\!\left(\mathbf{0},\,\sigma^2(t_0)s^2(t_0)\mathbf I\right)\\[-0.2em]
3:&amp;\quad\textbf{for }i\in\{0,\ldots,N-1\}\textbf{ do}\\[-0.2em]
4:&amp;\qquad\displaystyle\mathbf d_i\leftarrow\left(\frac{\dot\sigma(t_i)}{\sigma(t_i)}+\frac{\dot s(t_i)}{s(t_i)}\right)\mathbf x_i-\frac{\dot\sigma(t_i)s(t_i)}{\sigma(t_i)}D_\theta\!\left(\frac{\mathbf x_i}{s(t_i)};\sigma(t_i)\right)\\[-0.2em]
5:&amp;\qquad\mathbf x_{i+1}\leftarrow\mathbf x_i+(t_{i+1}-t_i)\mathbf d_i\\[-0.2em]
6:&amp;\qquad\textbf{if }\sigma(t_{i+1})\ne0\textbf{ then}\\[-0.2em]
7:&amp;\qquad\quad\displaystyle\mathbf d'_i\leftarrow\left(\frac{\dot\sigma(t_{i+1})}{\sigma(t_{i+1})}+\frac{\dot s(t_{i+1})}{s(t_{i+1})}\right)\mathbf x_{i+1}-\frac{\dot\sigma(t_{i+1})s(t_{i+1})}{\sigma(t_{i+1})}D_\theta\!\left(\frac{\mathbf x_{i+1}}{s(t_{i+1})};\sigma(t_{i+1})\right)\\[-0.2em]
8:&amp;\qquad\quad\mathbf x_{i+1}\leftarrow\mathbf x_i+(t_{i+1}-t_i)\left(\tfrac12\mathbf d_i+\tfrac12\mathbf d'_i\right)\\[-0.2em]
9:&amp;\quad\textbf{return }\mathbf x_N
\end{array}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-340%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%20l%7D%5Cn1%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bprocedure%20%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BHeunSampler%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(D_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Csigma(t)%2C%5C%5C%2Cs(t)%2C%5C%5C%2Ct_%7Bi%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CN%5C%5C%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn2%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bsample%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_0%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2(t_0)s%5E2(t_0)%5C%5Cmathbf%20I%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn3%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Di%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CN-1%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20do%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn4%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Cmathbf%20d_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cdot%5C%5Csigma(t_i)%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma(t_i)%7D%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cdot%20s(t_i)%7D%7Bs(t_i)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cdot%5C%5Csigma(t_i)s(t_i)%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma(t_i)%7DD_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%7D%7Bs(t_i)%7D%3B%5C%5Csigma(t_i)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn5%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%2B(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D-t_i)%5C%5Cmathbf%20d_i%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn6%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bif%20%7D%5C%5Csigma(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%5C%5Cne0%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20then%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn7%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5C%5Cmathbf%20d'_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cdot%5C%5Csigma(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%7D%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cdot%20s(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%7D%7Bs(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D-%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cdot%5C%5Csigma(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)s(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%7DD_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%7D%7Bs(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%7D%3B%5C%5Csigma(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn8%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%2B(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D-t_i)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctfrac12%5C%5Cmathbf%20d_i%2B%5C%5Ctfrac12%5C%5Cmathbf%20d'_i%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn9%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_N%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</figure></section><p data-lake-id="u41879e58" id="u41879e58"><span data-lake-id="ucc3be7b7" id="ucc3be7b7">时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fyQ8T%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8aad60b9" id="u8aad60b9">决定不同噪声水平下步长及截断误差的分布方式：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8508a89" id="ud8508a89">随着</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZRVIh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9104765c" id="u9104765c">的减小，步长应当单调减小</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u16af8d90" id="u16af8d90">，且步长无需针对每个样本单独调整。基于此，作者采用一种参数化方案，通过噪声水平序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vIZAX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Csigma_i%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub90334b4" id="ub90334b4">定义时间步，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22N2khI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_i%3D%5C%5Csigma%5E%7B-1%7D(%5C%5Csigma_i)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaa3b9798" id="uaa3b9798">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc0e17feb" id="uc0e17feb" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="4"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VBRjS%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7Bi%3CN%7D%3D(Ai%2BB)%5E%5C%5Crho%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-4">(4)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u9f2818b8" id="u9f2818b8"><span data-lake-id="u537c8d2c" id="u537c8d2c">并选择常数 A 和 B，使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22k2vis%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_0%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8a77f698" id="u8a77f698">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Yp38U%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7BN-1%7D%3D%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u056a3d25" id="u056a3d25">，从而得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf0d4100e" id="uf0d4100e" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="5"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22K1mIq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7Bi%3CN%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Crho%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bi%7D%7BN-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Crho%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%5C%5Crho%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Crho%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Band%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csigma_N%20%3D%200%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-5">(5)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="ud2bfdf78" id="ud2bfdf78"><span data-lake-id="ue1bf5965" id="ue1bf5965">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Rr12T%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uce8e8b97" id="uce8e8b97">控制靠近</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jDF0O%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua48fec02" id="ua48fec02">处的步长压缩程度，即在缩短低噪声区域步长的同时，允许高噪声区域使用更长步长。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dC1yP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho%3D3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u36a152ea" id="u36a152ea">几乎可以使每一步的截断误差相对均衡，但在图像采样任务中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WULTo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u039f0263" id="u039f0263">取 5 至 10 的范围效果更佳，这说明低噪声区域的误差对最终结果影响更大。基于实验，论文其余部分统一采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TXtsx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Crho%3D7%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7d6d45d9" id="u7d6d45d9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u177332c7" id="u177332c7">噪声与信号缩放调度通过轨迹曲率影响离散化误差。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8e7a3fba" id="u8e7a3fba">ODE 解轨迹的形状由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ppQtb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u975cb878" id="u975cb878">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22j2KEg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaae65035" id="uaae65035">两个函数共同决定。对这两个函数的选择，实际上也提供一条降低上述截断误差的途径，因为误差大小通常与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Cfkhe%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx%2Fdt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71b35b21" id="u71b35b21">的曲率成正比。作者认为最优选择应为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nKOsL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%3Dt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79f9fd7e" id="u79f9fd7e">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Ny2lm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s(t)%3D1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7062955" id="ub7062955">，这也是 DDIM 所采用的设置</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6d488de5" id="u6d488de5" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="6"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iSMRT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx%2Fdt%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx-D(x%3Bt)%7D%7Bt%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-6">(6)</span></p><ul list="u511a0a88"><li fid="u7050d8d6" data-lake-id="uc226ce9d" id="uc226ce9d"><span data-lake-id="u577cd272" id="u577cd272">对于任意给定的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QTIlJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf680f31a" id="uf680f31a">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xDrsk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32c180ff" id="u32c180ff">，只需执行一次到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XXv59%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufb81b8cb" id="ufb81b8cb">的 Euler 步，就可得到去噪图像</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CPANK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3Bt)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u743b472c" id="u743b472c">。因此，解轨迹的切向方向始终指向去噪器输出。这意味着该方向通常只会随噪声水平缓慢变化，也即解轨迹整体上接近线性</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="DyRWC" id="DyRWC"><span data-lake-id="u8f790756" id="u8f790756"> </span><span data-lake-id="ub6204564" id="ub6204564">🐶</span><span data-lake-id="ucdee8ffa" id="ucdee8ffa"> 𝑺𝒕𝒐𝒄𝒉𝒂𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒄 𝒔𝒂𝒎𝒑𝒍𝒊𝒏𝒈</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf900f153" id="uf900f153"><span data-lake-id="uca4d5491" id="uca4d5491">确定性采样具有诸多优势，例如可以通过对 ODE 进行逆向求解，将真实图像映射为其对应的潜在表示。然而，与在每一步中向图像注入新噪声的随机采样相比，确定性采样往往会导致较差的生成质量。鉴于从理论上看，ODE 与 SDE 均可恢复相同的目标分布，那么</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u228fc53b" id="u228fc53b">随机性究竟发挥什么作用</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u15fd3fec" id="u15fd3fec">，便成为一个值得深入探讨的问题</span></p><p data-lake-id="u09bee356" id="u09bee356"><strong><span data-lake-id="u61e96120" id="u61e96120">Song 等提出的 SDE 可进一步推广为：由概率流 ODE 与一个时变的 Langevin diffusion SDE 共同构成的形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6585d84a" id="u6585d84a"></span></p><p data-lake-id="ua302d4d6" id="ua302d4d6" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="7"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22E59iI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7B%5C%5Cpm%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma(t))%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bprobability%20flow%20ODE%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%20%5C%5Cpm%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cbeta(t)%5C%5Csigma(t)%5E2%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20p(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma(t))%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdeterministic%20noise%20decay%7D%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B2%5C%5Cbeta(t)%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Comega_t%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bnoise%20injection%7D%7D%20%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BLangevin%20diffusion%20SDE%7D%7D%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-7">(7)</span></p><ul list="uc3c6598e"><li fid="uf00157a5" data-lake-id="uecee40de" id="uecee40de"><span data-lake-id="ua7a31158" id="ua7a31158">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22u4nWv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubcfb3cba" id="ubcfb3cba">表示标准 Wiener 过程。此时，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22unBc0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx%5E%2B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c3fe2de" id="u6c3fe2de">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TamIL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx%5E-%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9c4f323" id="ua9c4f323">分别对应时间正向与反向演化的两个 SDE，它们之间通过 Anderson 的时间反演公式联系起来。进一步地，Langevin 项还可被理解为由一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5a849c9a" id="u5a849c9a">基于 score 的确定性去噪项</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue2b27706" id="ue2b27706">与一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5901af0c" id="u5901af0c">随机噪声注入项</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud3a69e66" id="ud3a69e66">所共同组成，而二者在净噪声水平上的贡献彼此抵消。因此，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RzhwP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9a5d6f1" id="ub9a5d6f1">实际上表征</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u170f8295" id="u170f8295">旧噪声被新噪声替换的相对速率</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ued43e5b4" id="ued43e5b4">。当取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lHYLZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%2F%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u31d98054" id="u31d98054">时，便可恢复 Song 等人的原始 SDE；在该特例下，score 项在前向 SDE 中消失</span></li><li fid="uf00157a5" data-lake-id="u32ce3032" id="u32ce3032"><span data-lake-id="ufcc359f8" id="ufcc359f8">揭示随机性在实践中为何有助于提升性能：隐式的 Langevin diffusion 会在给定时刻主动推动样本向目标边缘分布靠近，从而不断纠正前面采样步骤中累积的误差。另一方面，以离散 SDE 求解器来近似 Langevin 项本身也会引入新的误差。已有研究表明，取非零的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kdDnW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90ed2880" id="u90ed2880">通常是有益的，但就作者所见，Song 等人对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eAI2G%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1ac4716" id="ud1ac4716">的隐式设定并不具有某种特殊的最优性质。因此，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2c42d69" id="ue2c42d69">最优的随机性强度应通过经验实验加以确定</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8c025324" id="u8c025324"><strong><span data-lake-id="u49650506" id="u49650506">作者提出一种随机采样器，将前文的二阶确定性 ODE 积分器与显式的、类似 Langevin 的 churn 操作结合起来，即在每一步中交替执行加噪与去噪</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3e9854be" id="u3e9854be">。在第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EnYnj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u654955a5" id="u654955a5">步，已知噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HmJBr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_i(%3D%5C%5Csigma(t_i))%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4aac1c54" id="u4aac1c54">下的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KZSKJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefdf3e42" id="uefdf3e42">后，作者执行两个子步骤</span></p><ul list="u99441a2b"><li fid="u4ff9c869" data-lake-id="ufdbdcb8a" id="ufdbdcb8a"><span data-lake-id="ue68ce594" id="ue68ce594">第一步，根据一个非负系数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IrPkG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma_i%20%5C%5Cge%200%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7cd3ed85" id="u7cd3ed85">，向样本中添加噪声，使其到达更高的噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22o2yST%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bt%7D_i%20%3D%20t_i%20%2B%20%5C%5Cgamma_i%20t_i%22%7D"></card></li></ul><ul list="u97820020"><li fid="u3e58a45a" data-lake-id="uc2de9b9a" id="uc2de9b9a"><span data-lake-id="ued5f554e" id="ued5f554e">第二步，从加噪后的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oDvwK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_i%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u351c17c4" id="u351c17c4">出发，通过一次单步 ODE 反向求解，将其从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tqe8u%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bt%7D_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u32777682" id="u32777682">推进到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OnuzN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bi%2B1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0df5f26c" id="u0df5f26c">。由此得到噪声水平为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22frKHg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bi%2B1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc2189602" id="uc2189602">的样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LVDah%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u374b5c03" id="u374b5c03">，并继续下一轮迭代</span></li><li fid="u3e58a45a" data-lake-id="uc0dfef33" id="uc0dfef33"><span data-lake-id="u1f4c6525" id="u1f4c6525">作者特别强调，这并不是一个通用型 SDE 求解器，而是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6875bf72" id="u6875bf72">针对当前采样问题专门设计的采样程序</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue7dfbedf" id="ue7dfbedf">。其正确性来源于两个子步骤的交替执行：二者各自都能保持正确的目标分布（ODE 步除截断误差外）</span></li><li fid="u3e58a45a" data-lake-id="u6cbe674d" id="u6cbe674d"><span data-lake-id="u9c86c032" id="u9c86c032">Euler–Maruyama 可以被理解为：首先添加噪声，然后执行一个 ODE 步；但这一 ODE 步并非从加噪后的中间状态出发，而是仍假定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rBtCX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u65bd2d2d" id="u65bd2d2d">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22j8fSK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u142c9284" id="u142c9284">保持在该迭代开始时的初始状态。相比之下，在作者的方法中，算法 2 第 7 行用于评估</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Vw7Vf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u78e1625a" id="u78e1625a">的参数对应的是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u83335302" id="u83335302">噪声注入之后的状态</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucf854d67" id="ucf854d67">，而类 Euler–Maruyama 的方法则会使用原始的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ETyJz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(x_i%2Ct_i)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7c903e48" id="u7c903e48">，而不是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PjGWE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_i%2C%5C%5Chat%7Bt%7D_i)%22%7D"></card></li></ul><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="edm-algorithm-2">
<figcaption id="edm-algorithm-2"><strong>Algorithm 2</strong> Stochastic Sampling With <i>σ(t)</i> = <i>t</i> And <i>s(t)</i> = 1</figcaption>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{r l}
1:&amp;\textbf{procedure }\operatorname{StochasticSampler}\!\left(D_\theta(x;\sigma),\,t_{i\in\{0,\ldots,N\}},\,\gamma_{i\in\{0,\ldots,N-1\}},\,S_{\mathrm{noise}}\right)\\[-0.2em]
2:&amp;\quad\textbf{sample }\mathbf x_0\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,t_0^2\mathbf I)\\[-0.2em]
3:&amp;\quad\textbf{for }i\in\{0,\ldots,N-1\}\textbf{ do}\\[-0.2em]
&amp;\qquad\gamma_i=\begin{cases}\min\!\left(S_{\mathrm{churn}}/N,\sqrt2-1\right)&amp;\text{if }t_i\in[S_{\mathrm{tmin}},S_{\mathrm{tmax}}]\\0&amp;\text{otherwise}\end{cases}\\[-0.2em]
4:&amp;\qquad\textbf{sample }\boldsymbol\epsilon_i\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,S_{\mathrm{noise}}^2\mathbf I)\\[-0.2em]
5:&amp;\qquad\hat t_i\leftarrow t_i+\gamma_i t_i\\[-0.2em]
6:&amp;\qquad\hat{\mathbf x}_i\leftarrow\mathbf x_i+\sqrt{\hat t_i^2-t_i^2}\,\boldsymbol\epsilon_i\\[-0.2em]
7:&amp;\qquad\mathbf d_i\leftarrow\left(\hat{\mathbf x}_i-D_\theta(\hat{\mathbf x}_i;\hat t_i)\right)/\hat t_i\\[-0.2em]
8:&amp;\qquad\mathbf x_{i+1}\leftarrow\hat{\mathbf x}_i+(t_{i+1}-\hat t_i)\mathbf d_i\\[-0.2em]
9:&amp;\qquad\textbf{if }t_{i+1}\ne0\textbf{ then}\\[-0.2em]
10:&amp;\qquad\quad\mathbf d'_i\leftarrow\left(\mathbf x_{i+1}-D_\theta(\mathbf x_{i+1};t_{i+1})\right)/t_{i+1}\\[-0.2em]
11:&amp;\qquad\quad\mathbf x_{i+1}\leftarrow\hat{\mathbf x}_i+(t_{i+1}-\hat t_i)\left(\tfrac12\mathbf d_i+\tfrac12\mathbf d'_i\right)\\[-0.2em]
12:&amp;\quad\textbf{return }\mathbf x_N
\end{array}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-341%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%20l%7D%5Cn1%3A%26%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bprocedure%20%7D%5C%5Coperatorname%7BStochasticSampler%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(D_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%2C%5C%5C%2Ct_%7Bi%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CN%5C%5C%7D%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cgamma_%7Bi%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CN-1%5C%5C%7D%7D%2C%5C%5C%2CS_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnoise%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn2%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bsample%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_0%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2Ct_0%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn3%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Di%5C%5Cin%5C%5C%7B0%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CN-1%5C%5C%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20do%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cgamma_i%3D%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(S_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bchurn%7D%7D%2FN%2C%5C%5Csqrt2-1%5C%5Cright)%26%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7Dt_i%5C%5Cin%5BS_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btmin%7D%7D%2CS_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btmax%7D%7D%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C0%26%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn4%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bsample%20%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%5C%5Cepsilon_i%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2CS_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bnoise%7D%7D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn5%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Chat%20t_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%20t_i%2B%5C%5Cgamma_i%20t_i%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn6%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_i%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Chat%20t_i%5E2-t_i%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%5C%5Cepsilon_i%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn7%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20d_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_i-D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_i%3B%5C%5Chat%20t_i)%5C%5Cright)%2F%5C%5Chat%20t_i%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn8%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_i%2B(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D-%5C%5Chat%20t_i)%5C%5Cmathbf%20d_i%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn9%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bif%20%7Dt_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5C%5Cne0%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20then%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn10%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20d'_i%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D-D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%3Bt_%7Bi%2B1%7D)%5C%5Cright)%2Ft_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn11%3A%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bi%2B1%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_i%2B(t_%7Bi%2B1%7D-%5C%5Chat%20t_i)%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Ctfrac12%5C%5Cmathbf%20d_i%2B%5C%5Ctfrac12%5C%5Cmathbf%20d'_i%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn12%3A%26%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Breturn%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_N%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</figure></section><h2 data-lake-id="Z8Obz" id="Z8Obz"><span data-lake-id="uc2342378" id="uc2342378">🦔</span><span data-lake-id="u1c610f8c" id="u1c610f8c"> 𝑷𝒓𝒆𝒄𝒐𝒏𝒅𝒊𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝒕𝒓𝒂𝒊𝒏𝒊𝒏𝒈</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8e70d2c5" id="u8e70d2c5"><span data-lake-id="u176e9a37" id="u176e9a37">在监督学习训练神经网络时，已有许多被广泛认可的良好实践。例如，通常建议将输入与输出信号的幅值保持在相对稳定的范围内，如单位方差，并避免不同样本之间梯度幅值出现过大波动。若直接训练神经网络去建模</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KGr1Y%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4369302e" id="u4369302e">，显然并不理想。原因在于，输入</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22U73Dr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%3Dy%2Bn%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7e50be3" id="ud7e50be3">由干净信号</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22a3GYj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc3ef5136" id="uc3ef5136">与噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yX8pV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(0%2C%5C%5Csigma%5E2I)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9eeed52d" id="u9eeed52d">共同构成，其幅值会随着噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RY10w%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u72a50061" id="u72a50061">的变化而发生巨大改变。正因如此，现有方法通常并不直接将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UylaD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79b77aa4" id="u79b77aa4">表示为神经网络本身，而是转而训练另一个网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nZ2M8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3a7d0e6c" id="u3a7d0e6c">，再由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Acwmi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u810e12c6" id="u810e12c6">构造出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22j7GMV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6fd9aba3" id="u6fd9aba3"><span data-lake-id="u65bb9cb4" id="u65bb9cb4">已有方法通过引入依赖于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vAP36%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9602433c" id="u9602433c">的归一化因子来处理输入缩放问题，并尝试通过训练</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22W1aN2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3b354539" id="u3b354539">去预测经缩放后具有单位方差的噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MGUj4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0ad9d8ab" id="u0ad9d8ab">来实现输出预条件化，随后再利用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JipR2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%3Dx-%5C%5Csigma%20F_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue8c10d84" id="ue8c10d84">恢复信号。然而，这种做法存在一个缺点</span></p><ul list="uaf72aef1"><li fid="u42989c94" data-lake-id="u7099bec8" id="u7099bec8"><span data-lake-id="uda2b42c7" id="uda2b42c7">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22g5syY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucfa041d6" id="ucfa041d6">较大时，网络必须极为精细地调整其输出，才能恰好抵消已有噪声</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wahHl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u10d8ca99" id="u10d8ca99">，并使输出保持在正确尺度上；需要注意的是，网络产生的任何误差都会被</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22obi8T%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffcec317" id="uffcec317">放大。在这种情形下，直接预测期望输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kgx6w%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucfdcf278" id="ucfdcf278">似乎会更容易</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue2db4d5e" id="ue2db4d5e"><span data-lake-id="u568f150f" id="u568f150f">延续以往参数化方法中自适应混合信号与噪声的思想，提出利用一个依赖于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22C2Jyu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u040ee034" id="u040ee034">的 skip connection 对神经网络进行预条件化，使其既可以估计</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qthUV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22y%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5f9eeae" id="ue5f9eeae">，也可以估计 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ny9Er%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uec0f0d1c" id="uec0f0d1c">，或者估计二者之间的某种中间形式</span></p><p data-lake-id="u19ca86c6" id="u19ca86c6" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="8"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RVjAo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D_%5C%5Ctheta(x%3B%5C%5Csigma)%3Dc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)x%2Bc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%5C%5C%2C%20F_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C!%5C%5Cbig(c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bin%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)x%3B%5C%5C%2Cc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bnoise%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%5C%5Cbig)%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-8">(8)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4892e7d0" id="u4892e7d0"><span data-lake-id="u3e257169" id="u3e257169">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22t85PQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7e6e86de" id="u7e6e86de">是待训练的神经网络，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22khAiA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf3b8e6a5" id="uf3b8e6a5">用于调节 skip connection，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vbz8S%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bin%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucaa4bcab" id="ucaa4bcab">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uaiIT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4fa675b5" id="u4fa675b5">分别控制输入与输出的幅值缩放，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Bjq1u%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bnoise%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u24f6fe13" id="u24f6fe13">则负责将噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22X7xis%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud300b175" id="ud300b175">映射为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SC1LT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u753b0077" id="u753b0077">的条件输入。整体训练损失如下</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue3c6a1b3" id="ue3c6a1b3" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="9"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NsuCA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Csigma%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Csigma)%20%5C%5C%7C%20D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D%3B%20%5C%5Csigma)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20where%20%7D%20%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Btrain%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2%20%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D)%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-9">(9)</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc8bc91dc" id="uc8bc91dc"><span data-lake-id="ue5720dd9" id="ue5720dd9">给定噪声水平</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22q6hRT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube043f40" id="ube043f40">被采样到的概率由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fPgel%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Btrain%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7e6633e" id="ub7e6633e">决定，相应的损失权重由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rkmMH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b3124d8" id="u4b3124d8">决定。进一步将该损失改写为关于原始网络输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22s1u0s%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u423f51b0" id="u423f51b0">的形式</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf29ec7cf" id="uf29ec7cf" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="rjvzt" data-equation-number="10"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qdeA5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7B%5C%5Csigma%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Csigma)%20c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%5E2%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Beffective%20weight%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cbigg%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7BF_%5C%5Ctheta(c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bin%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D)%3B%20c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bnoise%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma))%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bnetwork%20output%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cunderbrace%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%7D%20(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20-%20c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7By%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bn%7D))%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Beffective%20training%20target%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cbigg%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-rjvzt-10">(10)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u67e50801" id="u67e50801"><span data-lake-id="u91db0661" id="u91db0661">损失加权与噪声采样：预条件化网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yPHta%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64ecaa67" id="u64ecaa67">的有效损失权重为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22E56s6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Csigma)c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%5E2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u20fc7642" id="u20fc7642">。为使各噪声水平的有效权重均为 1，取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22K69Uw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Csigma)%20%3D%201%20%2F%20c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%5E2%20.%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9c48a9b" id="ub9c48a9b">噪声采样分布</span><span data-lake-id="u868495fd" id="u868495fd"></span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OF9n4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Btrain%7D%7D(%5C%5Csigma)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0fa7f405" id="u0fa7f405">采用</span><span data-lake-id="uddd61bf2" id="uddd61bf2"></span><strong><span data-lake-id="u784ba707" id="u784ba707">对数正态分布</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u912a6893" id="u912a6893"></span><span data-lake-id="u0c4b4de3" id="u0c4b4de3">，将训练集中于损失改善更明显的中等噪声区间</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9c9e0b3e" id="u9c9e0b3e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A725.8182373046875%2C%22height%22%3A432.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1152%2C%22originHeight%22%3A685%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4d6e47b1%22%7D" data-asset="assets/f1233bf271fb82b69c1113331d0d4c08.png"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id="hq7OY" id="hq7OY"><span data-lake-id="u18fe81d1" id="u18fe81d1">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="ue6b3106b" id="ue6b3106b"> 𝐃𝐏𝐌-𝐬𝐨𝐥𝐯𝐞𝐫</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u4e5900d8" id="u4e5900d8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ba15b7e" id="u5ba15b7e">扩散概率模型（DPMs）正逐渐成为一类性能强大的生成模型。DPMs 可以由离散时间随机过程或连续时间随机微分方程所定义，其核心思想是学习逐步去除施加在数据样本上的噪声。与广泛使用的生成对抗网络和变分自编码器相比，DPMs 不仅能够计算精确似然，而且在图像生成任务上往往能够获得更好的样本质量</span></strong>。<span data-lake-id="uc68c564c" id="uc68c564c"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5865a7b" id="uc5865a7b">现有的 DPM 快速采样方法大致可分为两类</span></strong></span></p><ul list="ua17bc4dc"><li fid="u604d69da" data-lake-id="ube04a149" id="ube04a149"><span data-lake-id="ue4738d19" id="ue4738d19">第一类包括</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0283b0d2" id="u0283b0d2">知识蒸馏以及噪声水平或样本轨迹学习</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u13538629" id="u13538629">。这类方法在高效采样之前通常需要一个可能代价较高的训练阶段。此外，它们的适用性和灵活性也可能受到限制，因为将方法迁移到不同模型、数据集或不同采样步数设定下，往往需要付出额外努力</span></li><li fid="u604d69da" data-lake-id="u311a3f61" id="u311a3f61"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf52dfdd0" id="uf52dfdd0">第二类是免训练采样器，其能够以一种简单的即插即用方式适用于任意预训练 DPM</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubfa95520" id="ubfa95520">。免训练采样器主要包括采用隐式或解析式的生成过程、先进的微分方程求解器，以及动态规划方法。然而，这些方法通常仍然需要约 50 次函数评估才能生成高质量样本，而这种质量大致才可与基础采样器在约 1000 次函数评估下生成的结果相当，因此依旧较为耗时</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc769996a" id="uc769996a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ude4ad9b0" id="ude4ad9b0" style="color: #000000">作者进一步将免训练采样器的效率提升到新的水平，使其能够在少步采样（few-step sampling）场景下生成高质量样本，即在大约 10 步顺序函数评估内完成采样</span></strong></p><ul list="u1b3eef7c"><li fid="uc834c556" data-lake-id="ub43c6f41" id="ub43c6f41"><span data-lake-id="ue3519897" id="ue3519897">将 DPM 采样视为求解相应扩散常微分方程的问题，并对扩散 ODE 的结构进行细致分析。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3c863982" id="u3c863982" style="color: #270070">扩散 ODE 具有一种半线性结构，即它由数据变量的线性函数与由神经网络参数化的非线性函数共同构成</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1f9f9092" id="u1f9f9092">。此前的免训练采样方法并未充分利用这一结构，而是直接采用黑盒微分方程求解器</span></li><li fid="uc834c556" data-lake-id="ua76f8a0a" id="ua76f8a0a"><span data-lake-id="ue0c6fddf" id="ue0c6fddf">为充分利用这一半线性结构，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u68f471a9" id="u68f471a9" style="color: #7E45E8">通过对解的线性部分进行解析计算，推导出扩散 ODE 解的精确表达，从而避免线性部分离散化所引入的误差。进一步地，通过变量替换，该解又可等价地化简为神经网络项的指数加权积分</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u38bdb96f" id="u38bdb96f">。由于这种积分形式具有特殊结构，因此可以借助指数积分器的数值方法进行高效近似</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u54e8e475" id="u54e8e475"><strong><span data-lake-id="u1d861825" id="u1d861825" style="color: #70000D">基于上述解的形式化表达，提出 DPM-Solver，通过对上述积分进行近似来高效求解扩散 ODE。构建 DPM-Solver 的一阶、二阶和三阶版本，并为其提供收敛阶保证。还进一步为 DPM-Solver 设计自适应步长调度策略。总体而言，DPM-Solver 既适用于连续时间 DPM，也适用于离散时间 DPM，同时还可用于带有分类器引导的条件采样</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="gTzQP" id="gTzQP"><span data-lake-id="u40118660" id="u40118660">🕊️</span><span data-lake-id="ufd5d9aaf" id="ufd5d9aaf"> 𝑫𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑷𝒓𝒐𝒃𝒂𝒃𝒊𝒍𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒄 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ue58bdd50" id="ue58bdd50"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5efb555c" id="u5efb555c">前向过程与扩散 SDE：设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hCdph%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5ED%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc04f6445" id="uc04f6445">是</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pTzvR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1070cf05" id="u1070cf05">维随机变量，其分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GsBht%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_0(x_0)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ub6bc45bf" id="ub6bc45bf">未知。扩散概率模型定义一个以前向时间演化过程</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OzFjc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bx_t%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%7D%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99cc7aa1" id="u99cc7aa1">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GDNdv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%3E0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67e0decf" id="u67e0decf">，且该过程以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bLhVj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud48056a7" id="ud48056a7">为起点，使得对任意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lRpZP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2363de5d" id="u2363de5d">，在给定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uDZh2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u03df4ab5" id="u03df4ab5">的条件下，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xnNwq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u77a7d4f2" id="u77a7d4f2">的条件分布满足</span></p><p data-lake-id="u657e065e" id="u657e065e" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="1"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZlFQb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20q_%7B0t%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7C%5C%5Calpha(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%2C%20%5C%5Csigma%5E2(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-1">(1)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubaea755d" id="ubaea755d"><span data-lake-id="ue83a61e9" id="ue83a61e9">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HnPKA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha(t)%2C%5C%5Csigma(t)%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D_%2B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4e5fea8b" id="u4e5fea8b">是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22drB8a%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u533470ba" id="u533470ba">的可微函数，且其导数有界。为简便起见，分别记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kCv0e%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%2C%5C%5Csigma_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u89047be9" id="u89047be9">。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gYu1w%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucda580b8" id="ucda580b8">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dx82B%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u55088f14" id="u55088f14">的具体选取被称为 DPM 的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9972e7b" id="ua9972e7b">噪声调度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucc9f5fd7" id="ucc9f5fd7">。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22luAen%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_t(x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua81d020e" id="ua81d020e">表示</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WF1sk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2cb4ab78" id="u2cb4ab78">的边缘分布，DPM 通过适当设计噪声调度，使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kg8aL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_T(x_T)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x_T%7C0%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E2I)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0a3e77af" id="u0a3e77af">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dwuNC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%3E0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6320d225" id="u6320d225">，要求信噪比</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22N5GL5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5E2%2F%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u561d73b5" id="u561d73b5">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bn378%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0224e0f6" id="u0224e0f6">严格单调递减。进一步地，Kingma 等证明，对于任意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sSTD3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u27f25bb0" id="u27f25bb0">，如下随机微分方程与上式具有相同的转移分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tBvPN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_%7B0t%7D(x_t%7Cx_0)%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u35588ee9" id="u35588ee9" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="2"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wyNvo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20f(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bw%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0%20%5C%5Csim%20q_0(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-2">(2)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u68511710" id="u68511710" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="3"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OV5lq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20f(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20g%5E2(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20-%202%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-3">(3)</span></p><p data-lake-id="uffa6a3c5" id="uffa6a3c5"><span data-lake-id="u53f013fc" id="u53f013fc">在一定正则条件下，Song 等证明，所定义的前向过程存在一个等价的逆向过程，该过程从时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22x6ij4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7242e294" id="u7242e294">演化至 0，并以边缘分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22T726T%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_T(x_T)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4f12365" id="ud4f12365">为初始分布</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucdc16ff9" id="ucdc16ff9" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="4"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pyG6I%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5Bf(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20g%5E2(t)%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%5D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bw%7D%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%20%5C%5Csim%20q_T(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-4">(4)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u24934524" id="u24934524"><span data-lake-id="u34491414" id="u34491414">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mfjr5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbar%7Bw%7D_t%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cc33a60" id="u1cc33a60">表示逆时间方向上的标准 Wiener 过程。唯一未知的项是任意时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kvKKD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u07c9e9f9" id="u07c9e9f9">对应的 score function </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22P0oXR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cnabla_x%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(x_t).%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1d4e3eb" id="ud1d4e3eb">DPM 使用参数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ip22Y%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9a83848d" id="u9a83848d">的神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZuTKf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25f77a1b" id="u25f77a1b">来估计缩放后的 score function，即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CPmqO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cnabla_x%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69b994d5" id="u69b994d5">。参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hREdE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5d5cb183" id="u5d5cb183">通过最小化如下目标函数进行优化</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc2228460" id="uc2228460" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="5"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Bvkm8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D(%5C%5Ctheta%3B%20%5C%5Comega(t))%20%26%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cint_0%5ET%20%5C%5Comega(t)%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma_t%20%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cint_0%5ET%20%5C%5Comega(t)%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq_0(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_0)%7D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5C%7C%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%20%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20C%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-5">(5)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua5b65298" id="ua5b65298"><span data-lake-id="uf72f3a18" id="uf72f3a18">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TU0Q1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Comega(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u922f8803" id="u922f8803">为加权函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Sjekl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%5C%5Csim%20q(%5C%5Cepsilon)%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon%7C0%2CI)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua1e9ce68" id="ua1e9ce68">，且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vC4WD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%3D%5C%5Calpha_tx_0%2B%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u656dea31" id="u656dea31">，常数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FwrCW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uffcc6c70" id="uffcc6c70">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22P60qX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6508ff7" id="ud6508ff7">无关。由于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eTgnD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udd90b8c1" id="udd90b8c1">也可以被理解为对加入到 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oGj7M%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1276e8fd" id="u1276e8fd">中的高斯噪声进行预测，通常被称</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7e640b81" id="u7e640b81">噪声预测模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5955b4bd" id="u5955b4bd">。鉴于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fY6Wk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u406aaad6" id="u406aaad6">所对应的真实目标为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zaYEJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Csigma_t%5C%5Cnabla_x%5C%5Clog%20q_t(x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fe27ac5" id="u8fe27ac5">，DPM 用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jPivr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%2F%5C%5Csigma_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3dfed0c4" id="u3dfed0c4">替代 score function，从而定义出如下参数化逆过程（即扩散 SDE），其从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XySPg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud76c186c" id="ud76c186c">时刻演化至 0，并以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lpR34%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_T%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2C%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E2I)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u65b72756" id="u65b72756">为初始条件</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubf48b378" id="ubf48b378" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="6"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XTz2M%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20f(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg%5E2(t)%7D%7B%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20g(t)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cbar%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bw%7D%7D_t%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E2%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-6">(6)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6126d3a0" id="u6126d3a0"><span data-lake-id="ubb6b3cd7" id="ubb6b3cd7">因此，可以通过数值求解器对扩散 SDE 从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MZTh4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0da60ebb" id="u0da60ebb">到 0 进行离散化求解，从而生成样本。Song 等证明，DPM 的传统 ancestral sampling 方法可以被视为一个一阶 SDE 求解器。然而，这类一阶方法通常需要数百次甚至数千次函数评估才能收敛，从而导致极其缓慢的采样速度</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3aa391b5" id="u3aa391b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub64587b9" id="ub64587b9">扩散（概率流）ODE：在对 SDE 进行离散化时，步长大小受到 Wiener 过程随机性的限制。当步长较大（即步数较少）时，离散求解往往难以收敛，尤其是在高维空间中更是如此</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4aa6fa83" id="u4aa6fa83">。为实现更快的采样，可以考虑与之对应</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud64cf3cf" id="ud64cf3cf">概率流常微分方程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uefa327a2" id="uefa327a2">，该 ODE 在每一时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22erhUo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ube07e3dd" id="ube07e3dd">上都与原 SDE 具有相同的边缘分布。对于 DPM，Song 等证明，对应的概率流 ODE 可写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub26292fb" id="ub26292fb" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="7"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ESuUz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%3D%20f(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7Dg%5E2(t)%5C%5Cnabla_%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20q_t(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%20%5C%5Csim%20q_T(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T)%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-7">(7)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u403846ad" id="u403846ad"><span data-lake-id="ub3d8eac1" id="ub3d8eac1">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qu5KZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u92501aef" id="u92501aef">的边缘分布同样为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PmvCZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22q_t(x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc54f7e02" id="uc54f7e02">。进一步地，若用噪声预测模型替代 score function，则 Song 等定义如下参数化 ODE</span></p><p data-lake-id="u67793df4" id="u67793df4" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="8"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uK3hE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bh%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%3A%3D%20f(t)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg%5E2(t)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_T%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B0%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Csigma%7D%5E2%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-8">(8)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3da77465" id="u3da77465"><span data-lake-id="u6be06a93" id="u6be06a93">样本可以通过求解该 ODE 并将时间从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22s0lEC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued2cda8c" id="ued2cda8c">推进到 0 来获得。与 SDE 相比，ODE 不包含随机项，因此允许采用更大的步长进行数值求解。此外，还可以借助高效的数值 ODE 求解器来进一步加速采样。Song 等采用 RK45 ODE 求解器来求解扩散 ODE，在 CIFAR-10 数据集上，仅需约 60 次函数评估，便可达到与对应的 1000 步 SDE 求解器相当的生成质量。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u195890c0" id="u195890c0" style="color: #004347">然而，现有通用型 ODE 求解器在少步采样（约 10 步）场景下，仍难以生成令人满意的样本。目前在少步采样场景下，针对 DPM 的免训练采样器仍然较为缺乏，DPM 的采样效率问题仍然是一个亟待解决的关键挑战</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="wqWQC" id="wqWQC"><span data-lake-id="u34d00969" id="u34d00969">🐇</span><span data-lake-id="u914b0304" id="u914b0304"> 𝑪𝒖𝒔𝒕𝒐𝒎𝒊𝒛𝒆𝒅 𝑭𝒂𝒔𝒕 𝑺𝒐𝒍𝒗𝒆𝒓𝒔 𝒇𝒐𝒓 𝑫𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑶𝑫𝑬𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ua6a1a26a" id="ua6a1a26a"><span data-lake-id="u9cbee7dd" id="u9cbee7dd"></span><strong><span data-lake-id="u65903517" id="u65903517">扩散 ODE 的线性部分可以精确计算，非线性部分则可转化为易于近似的积分。给定时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jQ764%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s%3E0%20%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0b294c4" id="uc0b294c4">处的初值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22n6PO0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_s%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3db2d37d" id="u3db2d37d">，考虑时刻</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CcL0l%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3Cs%20%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucefb1f5a" id="ucefb1f5a">处的解</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VlqyG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2584dee" id="ud2584dee">的求解过程。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8dd01d37" id="u8dd01d37"></span><span data-lake-id="u86686a3e" id="u86686a3e">利用扩散 ODE 的半线性结构，其解</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qOSED%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc29bc9a3" id="uc29bc9a3">的一部分实际上可以被精确计算。扩散 ODE 右端项由两部分构成：其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Qe2iU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(t)x_t%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9588fb37" id="u9588fb37">是关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yjxQT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u71557503" id="u71557503">的线性函数，而另一项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vn6XW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg%5E2(t)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ueb01dc46" id="ueb01dc46">由于神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WTbFA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39ed4864" id="u39ed4864">的存在，通常是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22e2q09%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42db7459" id="u42db7459">的非线性函数。这类 ODE 通常被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u04fc4334" id="u04fc4334" style="color: #270070">半线性 ODE</span></strong></p><ul><li id="dpm-ode-variation"><span data-lake-id="u877a653b" id="u877a653b"></span><strong><span data-lake-id="u468e5bbf" id="u468e5bbf" style="color: #663000">先前工作所采用的黑盒 ODE 求解器并未利用这种半线性结构，而是将整个</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aEcL4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22h_%5C%5Ctheta(x_t%2Ct)%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue6929309" id="ue6929309" style="color: #663000">视作输入统一处理，这会同时对线性项和非线性项引入离散化误差。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue043ad57" id="ue043ad57">对于半线性 ODE，其在时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22F7Yjz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e6dd26a" id="u2e6dd26a">的解可以通过常数变易公式被精确写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua07ebc04" id="ua07ebc04" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="9"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mAoiU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20e%5E%7B%5C%5Cint_s%5Et%20f(%5C%5Ctau)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Ctau%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_s%20%2B%20%5C%5Cint_s%5Et%20%5C%5Cleft(%20e%5E%7B%5C%5Cint_%5C%5Ctau%5Et%20f(r)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dr%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg%5E2(%5C%5Ctau)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_%5C%5Ctau%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctau%2C%20%5C%5Ctau)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Ctau%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-9">(9)</span></p><ul list="u47b9334f"><li fid="uebd098df" data-lake-id="u7637f9a4" id="u7637f9a4"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbf5e31f" id="ufbf5e31f" style="color: #2F8EF4">线性部分与非线性部分解耦</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u06ab1b4c" id="u06ab1b4c">。与黑盒 ODE 求解器不同，此时线性部分已被精确计算，从而消除线性项的近似误差。然而，非线性部分对应的积分仍然较为复杂，因为其中同时耦合与噪声调度有关的系数（即</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IBfvw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ctau)%2C%20g(%5C%5Ctau)%2C%20%5C%5Csigma_%5C%5Ctau%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9f8a7512" id="u9f8a7512">）以及复杂的神经网络</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22l2yq8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a3649d6" id="u2a3649d6">，因此仍难以直接近似</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u58f32bc0" id="u58f32bc0"><span data-lake-id="u5939df38" id="u5939df38"></span><span data-lake-id="u9ef47899" id="u9ef47899"></span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0d7c5176" id="u0d7c5176" style="color: #5C0036">简化非线性积分，定义</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eb0Cn%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_t%3A%3D%5C%5Clog(%5C%5Calpha_t%2F%5C%5Csigma_t)%2C%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u0930e6e0" id="u0930e6e0" style="color: #5C0036">即</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JhjrT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctext%7Blog-SNR%7D%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u01c6b94b" id="u01c6b94b" style="color: #5C0036">的一半</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue745c017" id="ue745c017">。</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22R0LoY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf39c2e63" id="uf39c2e63">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YOaNJ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16f894c5" id="u16f894c5">是严格单调递减的。可以将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UcYCP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22g(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u485dad4c" id="u485dad4c">重写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u46483ec8" id="u46483ec8" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="10"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22umfpE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20g%5E2(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20-%202%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%20%3D%202%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Csigma_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20-2%5C%5Csigma_t%5E2%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda_t%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%7D.%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-10">(10)</span></p><ul list="ucf5d8ec9"><li fid="u81fb5d3d" data-lake-id="uef27103c" id="uef27103c"><span data-lake-id="ubea6c219" id="ubea6c219">再结合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ls88U%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(t)%3Dd%5C%5Clog%5C%5Calpha_t%2Fdt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a7996c4" id="u7a7996c4">，进一步改写为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u911b83cc" id="u911b83cc" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="11"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KTSkv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_s%7D%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_s%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_t%20%5C%5Cint_s%5Et%20%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda_%5C%5Ctau%7D%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Ctau%7D%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%5C%5Ctau%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%5C%5Ctau%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Ctau%2C%20%5C%5Ctau)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Ctau.%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-11">(11)</span></p><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><ul>
<li><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-342%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(t)%22%7D"></card> 严格单调递减，记其反函数为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-343%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card>。令 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-344%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%3A%3Dx_%7Bt_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Clambda)%7D%22%7D"></card>，并记 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-345%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%3A%3D%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Clambda)%7D%2Ct_%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Clambda))%22%7D"></card>。将积分变量由时间换为 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-346%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%7D"></card>，利用 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-347%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma_t%2F%5C%5Calpha_t%3De%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda_t%7D%22%7D"></card>，即可得到扩散 ODE 的精确解</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation lake-numbered-block" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="x_t=\frac{\alpha_t}{\alpha_s}x_s-\alpha_t\int_{\lambda_s}^{\lambda_t}e^{-\lambda}\hat{\epsilon}_\theta(\hat{x}_\lambda,\lambda)\,\mathrm d\lambda
" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="12"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-348%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_t%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_s%7Dx_s-%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Clambda_s%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Clambda_t%7De%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathrm%20d%5C%5Clambda%5Cn%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-12">(12)</span></div>
<ul>
<li>线性部分由比例因子 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-349%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%2F%5C%5Calpha_s%22%7D"></card> 精确计算，非线性部分则化为噪声预测模型的<strong>指数加权积分</strong>。DPM-Solver 对这一积分进行数值近似，进而构造不同阶数的求解器</li>
</ul></section><p data-lake-id="u4dad6d73" id="u4dad6d73"><span data-lake-id="u8e920e7f" id="u8e920e7f"></span><strong><span data-lake-id="uaecba9d0" id="uaecba9d0"></span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4a6c735" id="ub4a6c735" style="color: #DF2A3F">对指数加权积分作泰勒展开，可以构造不同阶数的 DPM-Solver</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ud91d10c1" id="ud91d10c1">。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue6e9dc0c" id="ue6e9dc0c" style="color: #000000">给定时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22N9Cyw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ufaa590fd" id="ufaa590fd" style="color: #000000">处的初值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Q6C6a%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6701172d" id="u6701172d" style="color: #000000">，以及一组从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UUAGk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_0%3DT%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uf935c4b6" id="uf935c4b6" style="color: #000000">递减到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xr06p%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_M%3Dt_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%3E0%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u4c1878d5" id="u4c1878d5" style="color: #000000">的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BaHdK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M%2B1%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u00727016" id="u00727016" style="color: #000000">个时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Auh3v%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5EM%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u1cc36468" id="u1cc36468" style="color: #000000">。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WYfDj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_0%7D%3Dx_T%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5554a73" id="ua5554a73" style="color: #000000">为初始值。所提出的求解器通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UCy0L%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u73ecdb75" id="u73ecdb75" style="color: #000000">个迭代步骤，逐步计算一个序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22a4zcN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_i%7D%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5EM%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u37b2cb6e" id="u37b2cb6e" style="color: #000000">，以近似对应时间点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Lhh8N%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5EM%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u817e94a2" id="u817e94a2" style="color: #000000">处的真实解。特别地，最后一个迭代值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XUBfX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_M%7D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u29ade134" id="u29ade134" style="color: #000000">用于近似时刻 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u29ade134-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%22%7D"></card> 处的真实解</span></p><ul list="u3673d095"><li fid="u17819ae5" data-lake-id="ua63b08ef" id="ua63b08ef"><span data-lake-id="u2b4b9849" id="u2b4b9849" style="color: #000000">为减小</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KQRWM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_M%7D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="uadfed339" id="uadfed339" style="color: #000000">与时刻 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-uadfed339-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%22%7D"></card> 处真实解之间的误差，需要在每一步都尽可能减小各个</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qKh6D%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_i%7D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6c384f2c" id="u6c384f2c" style="color: #000000">的近似误差。从前一个时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fAZJC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bi-1%7D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u8c5d278f" id="u8c5d278f" style="color: #000000">的近似值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22y0nRT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u5996a53b" id="u5996a53b" style="color: #000000">出发，在时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Moraj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_i%20%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u46b19e23" id="u46b19e23" style="color: #000000">处的精确解</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dqOAo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e9ae765" id="u6e9ae765" style="color: #000000">可表示为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ufdbae431" id="ufdbae431" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="13"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ogcdP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%20%5C%5Clambda)%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda.%22%7D" style="color: #000000"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-13">(13)</span></p><ul list="u6881e68a"><li fid="u38ad9461" data-lake-id="u0d0872ef" id="u0d0872ef"><span data-lake-id="u40e40f1f" id="u40e40f1f">关键在于近似</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YINpQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u172caf34" id="u172caf34">从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TBpeQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba2108e7" id="uba2108e7">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LZBnv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7af78b79" id="u7af78b79">区间上的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u563ca9bf" id="u563ca9bf">指数加权积分</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u84e6f0d5" id="u84e6f0d5">。记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lB9jW%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22h_i%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D-%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u69a60343" id="u69a60343">并记</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22D3DYk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(n)%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bd%5En%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%7D%7Bd%5C%5Clambda%5En%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd61701e" id="ubd61701e">为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LIZQR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6abc2ccd" id="u6abc2ccd">关于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22adklX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5888e765" id="u5888e765">的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uZWdl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u178dd43c" id="u178dd43c">阶全导数。对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nGDY8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k%5C%5Cge%201%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uee4ffdbe" id="uee4ffdbe">，在 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zYNWE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0170dd11" id="u0170dd11">处对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LPWki%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucb27b0f1" id="ucb27b0f1">作</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YQml4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k-1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5532ffce" id="u5532ffce">阶泰勒展开，有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u855bf2fd" id="u855bf2fd" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="14"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CTLxm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%20%5C%5Clambda)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D0%7D%5E%7Bk-1%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Clambda%20-%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%5En%7D%7Bn!%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(n)%7D(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D((%5C%5Clambda%20-%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%5Ek)%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-14">(14)</span></p><ul list="u99a25ef8"><li fid="ue5540994" data-lake-id="u28ac05ce" id="u28ac05ce"><span data-lake-id="u78d9849c" id="u78d9849c">将上述泰勒展开代入，可得</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u901dadd5" id="u901dadd5" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="15"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22x4EKw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bn%3D0%7D%5E%7Bk-1%7D%20%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%7D_%5C%5Ctheta%5E%7B(n)%7D(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Clambda%20-%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%5En%7D%7Bn!%7D%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(h_i%5E%7Bk%2B1%7D)%2C%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-15">(15)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub461f999" id="ub461f999"><span data-lake-id="ub6fa127d" id="ub6fa127d">积分项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22HFdyb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cint%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B(%5C%5Clambda-%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D)%5En%7D%7Bn!%7D%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Clambda%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6fe658bd" id="u6fe658bd">可以通过重复应用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rIMtL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d44826a" id="u6d44826a">次分部积分解析求得。近似</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TYGPF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20x_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u86f2bd15" id="u86f2bd15">只需要近似</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22P9v7h%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%5C%5Cle%20k-1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6b6a1593" id="u6b6a1593">时的第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TMjDZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uba5e9a4e" id="uba5e9a4e">阶全导数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cF9tb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D%5E%7B(n)%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Clambda%2C%5C%5Clambda)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u789e793b" id="u789e793b">。通过舍去误差项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IHJGu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(h_i%5E%7Bk%2B1%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85485c23" id="u85485c23">，并利用 stiff order conditions 去近似前</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22t7R8y%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k-1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaf7ca7db" id="uaf7ca7db">阶全导数，便可以构造出扩散 ODE 的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bsdCy%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u07df2bf9" id="u07df2bf9">阶求解器。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6e47eacb" id="u6e47eacb" style="color: #000000">将这类求解器统称为 DPM-Solver，而其特定阶数版本记为 DPM-Solver-k</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u61d9f011" id="u61d9f011">。以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Zs25M%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k%3D1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0430bdf2" id="u0430bdf2">的情形为例进行说明</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubdee6530" id="ubdee6530" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="16"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YfTkj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%5C%5Cto%20t_i%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%2C%20t_%7Bi-1%7D)%20%5C%5Cint_%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%20e%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda%7D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Clambda%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(h_i%5E2)%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7Bt_i%7D(e%5E%7Bh_i%7D%20-%201)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%2C%20t_%7Bi-1%7D)%20%2B%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(h_i%5E2).%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-16">(16)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u91998dfb" id="u91998dfb"><strong><span data-lake-id="u014261ef" id="u014261ef">DPM-Solver-1 沿递减时间步执行一阶更新。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6e684130" id="u6e684130">给定时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fDi6f%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b79cffd" id="u8b79cffd">处的初始值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zOcLa%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf1aa02d" id="ucf1aa02d">，以及一组从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22clsmA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_0%3DT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c20a60d" id="u0c20a60d">递减至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22t9haZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_M%3Dt_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%3E0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u062f64ce" id="u062f64ce">的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vExkj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22M%2B1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0fde509" id="uc0fde509">个时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zEGRY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5EM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0833a361" id="u0833a361">。从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22P5MdC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_0%7D%3Dx_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf79afd59" id="uf79afd59">开始，序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22abU0J%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_i%7D%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4986f6ef" id="u4986f6ef">按如下方式迭代计算</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua537be4c" id="ua537be4c" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="17"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DtPAL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_i%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Csigma_%7Bt_i%7D(e%5E%7Bh_i%7D%20-%201)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cepsilon%7D_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%2C%20t_%7Bi-1%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bwhere%7D%5C%5Cquad%20h_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%20-%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D.%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-17">(17)</span></p><ul><li data-lake-id="u512ed79c" id="u512ed79c"><span data-lake-id="ue296f448" id="ue296f448">对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iAVUm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20k%5C%5Cge%202%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7edb10c9" id="u7edb10c9">的情形，为近似泰勒展开中的前</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MC7Iq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22k%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u482a1350" id="u482a1350">项，通常需要在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22t0zQd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufb9fe21b" id="ufb9fe21b">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22k2r4w%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20s%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u48a94a9d" id="u48a94a9d">之间引入额外的中间点</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u06b322f8" id="u06b322f8"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucfab4464" id="ucfab4464" data-lake-style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254)">定理 3.2（DPM-Solver-k 是一个 k 阶求解器）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud1711b77" id="ud1711b77">设噪声预测模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wR674%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2da7ccc6" id="u2da7ccc6">具有足够的正则性，即其关于状态与时间的变化足够平滑，使得所涉及的泰勒展开与高阶导数近似成立；同时</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22glDGX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f3f6f52" id="u5f3f6f52">对状态变量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22exa8G%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4a89ecf1" id="u4a89ecf1">满足 Lipschitz 连续条件。进一步离散求解时所采用的时间步长足够小，则对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Pu6tf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20k%3D1%2C2%2C3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1c088707" id="u1c088707">，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u318583d5" id="u318583d5">DPM-Solver-k 分别构成扩散 ODE 的一个 k 阶数值求解方法</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u3a4aa6f5" id="u3a4aa6f5" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="18"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RAD1J%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%20%5C%5Ctilde%7B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D%7D_%7Bt_M%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BO%7D(h_%7B%5C%5Cmax%7D%5Ek)%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7B%20where%20%7D%20h_%7Bmax%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmax_%7B1%20%5C%5Cle%20i%20%5C%5Cle%20M%7D(%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%20-%20%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D).%20%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-18">(18)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucc5ce81f" id="ucc5ce81f"><span data-lake-id="ub8d99c35" id="ub8d99c35"></span><span data-lake-id="u41a3bb72" id="u41a3bb72">当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u41a3bb72-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(0)%3D0%22%7D"></card> 时，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u41a3bb72-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(0)%22%7D"></card> 发散，不能直接代入有限步长公式；实际求解取正的终止时间 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u41a3bb72-3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%22%7D"></card>，并与同一终点的 ODE 精确解比较。需要零噪声输出时，再执行单独的最终去噪。求解器需要预先指定时间步序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aSmQi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bt_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D0%7D%5EM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8f146d4d" id="u8f146d4d">。作者提出两种时间步长调度方式</span></p><ul list="u3d5d76a9"><li fid="u1e52bfd2" data-lake-id="u308e2d4a" id="u308e2d4a"><span data-lake-id="ubfffcf80" id="ubfffcf80">其中一种是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u43b33ad8" id="u43b33ad8">手工设定的步长方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc5099c7a" id="uc5099c7a">，即在区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22quXbC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Clambda_T%2C%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uda290597" id="uda290597">上进行均匀划分，也就是说：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eV1Wy%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%3D%5C%5Clambda_T%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bi%7D%7BM%7D(%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7B%5C%5Cmin%7D%7D-%5C%5Clambda_T)%2C%5C%5Cquad%20i%3D0%2C%5C%5Cdots%2CM.%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u649612cf" id="u649612cf">经验结果表明，当采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aDy40%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9da24571" id="u9da24571">的均匀时间步时，DPM-Solver 在少步采样场景下已经能够生成质量相当不错的样本</span></li><li fid="u1e52bfd2" data-lake-id="u34f20d0a" id="u34f20d0a"><span data-lake-id="u3cf940ec" id="u3cf940ec">另一种方案是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u039116a5" id="u039116a5">自适应步长算法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7aa09a7a" id="u7aa09a7a">。该方法通过组合不同阶数的 DPM-Solver，动态调节步长大小</span></li></ul><ul><li data-lake-id="u535ed590" id="u535ed590"><span data-lake-id="u4329d49d" id="u4329d49d">对于少步采样而言，需要充分利用全部可用函数评估次数。当 NFE 不能被 3 整除时，作者的策略是：优先尽可能多地使用 DPM-Solver-3，随后根据 NFE 除以 3 的余数，再额外补充一步 DPM-Solver-1 或 DPM-Solver-2</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="sFmIy" id="sFmIy"><span data-lake-id="u2e7603b6" id="u2e7603b6">🦄</span><span data-lake-id="u6bfd5b15" id="u6bfd5b15"> 𝑪𝒐𝒎𝒑𝒂𝒓𝒊𝒔𝒐𝒏 𝒘𝒊𝒕𝒉 𝑬𝒙𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑭𝒂𝒔𝒕 𝑺𝒂𝒎𝒑𝒍𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑴𝒆𝒕𝒉𝒐𝒅𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub29a8a3c" id="ub29a8a3c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u85181e22" id="u85181e22">DDIM 作为 DPM-Solver-1 的特例：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub7d828f5" id="ub7d828f5">去噪扩散隐式模型提出一种从 DPM 中快速采样的确定性方法。对于相邻的两个时间步</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tQcd1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bi-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6d5ece61" id="u6d5ece61">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pcdyn%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73e9ee4d" id="u73e9ee4d">，假设在时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oJpza%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_%7Bi-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u438d18d0" id="u438d18d0">已有一个解</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GLQdy%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5419807c" id="u5419807c">，则 DDIM 从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22b5izC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20t_%7Bi-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua963958b" id="ua963958b">到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22TcNKf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20t_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc6ce65d8" id="uc6ce65d8">的单步更新可写为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubb94f173" id="ubb94f173" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="19"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IYOUQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_i%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ctilde%7Bx%7D_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%2Ct_%7Bi-1%7D).%20%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-19">(19)</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub3c06bc5" id="ub3c06bc5"><span data-lake-id="u228871e3" id="u228871e3">尽管 DDIM 与 DPM-Solver-1 的出发视角完全不同，作者指出，二者的更新公式实际上是完全一致的。根据</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22evTxr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub3452184" id="ub3452184">的定义，有</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub7efb722" id="ub7efb722" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="20"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22j1bgF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%3De%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Calpha_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%3De%5E%7B-%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-20">(20)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u14578e4b" id="u14578e4b"><span data-lake-id="ucc3f82c7" id="ucc3f82c7">将这些关系以及</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VdmHh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22h_i%3D%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_i%7D-%5C%5Clambda_%7Bt_%7Bi-1%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d374bd1" id="u8d374bd1">代入，便可精确得到 DPM-Solver-1 单步更新公式。因此，DDIM 实际上就是 DPM-Solver-1 的一个特例。不过，DPM-Solver 的优势在于，其基于扩散 ODE 的半线性结构进行建模，因此能够以一种更具原理性的方式推广到高阶求解器，并开展相应的收敛阶分析</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2f8a7cad" id="u2f8a7cad"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud778ce3a" id="ud778ce3a">与传统 Runge–Kutta 方法的比较：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2843ec0b" id="u2843ec0b">一种获得高阶求解器的直接思路，是将传统的显式 Runge–Kutta（RK）方法直接应用于扩散 ODE。RK 方法通常将解写为如下积分形式</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf6094d32" id="uf6094d32" style="text-align: center" class="lake-numbered-block" data-equation-paper="hq7OY" data-equation-number="21"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22c12Nn%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%3Dx_s%2B%5C%5Cint_s%5Et%20h_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%5C%5Ctau%2C%5C%5Ctau)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5Ctau%20%3D%20x_s%2B%5C%5Cint_s%5Et%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20f(%5C%5Ctau)x_%5C%5Ctau%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bg%5E2(%5C%5Ctau)%7D%7B2%5C%5Csigma_%5C%5Ctau%7D%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%5C%5Ctau%2C%5C%5Ctau)%20%5C%5Cright%5Dd%5C%5Ctau%22%7D"></card><span class="lake-block-equation-number" id="equation-hq7OY-21">(21)</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6fd5d9d6" id="u6fd5d9d6"><span data-lake-id="u3e1b159f" id="u3e1b159f">并在区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lF9J0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Bt%2Cs%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u27a57318" id="u27a57318">内选取若干中间时间点，通过组合这些时间点上对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZGl45%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22h_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua2f6b783" id="ua2f6b783">的函数评估来近似整个积分。然而，显式 RK 方法的近似误差取决于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Dn8lq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22h_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u430ceb32" id="u430ceb32">本身，而</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vlZR8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22h_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc98549a6" id="uc98549a6">同时包含线性项</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Too92%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20f(%5C%5Ctau)x_%5C%5Ctau%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud65f5277" id="ud65f5277">与非线性的噪声预测模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Nxw1c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17745b27" id="u17745b27">所带来的误差。问题在于，线性项的误差可能会被显著放大，因为线性项精确解中本身包含指数系数。已有大量经验研究表明，对于半线性 ODE，若直接采用显式 RK 方法并使用较大步长，往往会遭遇数值不稳定问题</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue28b5340" id="ue28b5340"><strong><span data-lake-id="uccbc92d0" id="uccbc92d0">面向 DPM 的训练型快速采样方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud3c9577f" id="ud3c9577f">：需要额外训练或优化的快速采样方法主要包括：知识蒸馏、学习噪声水平或方差，以及学习噪声调度或样本轨迹。尽管渐进式蒸馏方法可以将快速采样压缩到 4 步以内，但它需要额外的训练成本，并且会损失原始 DPM 中的部分信息。例如，在蒸馏之后，噪声预测模型将不再能够在区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wwi6U%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5B0%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8866ea15" id="u8866ea15">上的任意时间步都对噪声（即 score function）进行预测。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub5b950e7" id="ub5b950e7">免训练采样器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6b6c173b" id="u6b6c173b">能够完整保留原始模型中的全部信息，因此也更容易直接扩展到条件采样场景，例如通过结合原始模型和外部分类器来实现带有 classifier guidance 的条件采样</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="KxUOB" id="KxUOB"><span data-lake-id="uac5a6468" id="uac5a6468">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u87eac9d0" id="u87eac9d0"> 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ue3b8d428" id="ue3b8d428"><strong><span data-lake-id="u832520c0" id="u832520c0">一致性模型的核心目标，是在保留扩散模型迭代采样优势的基础上，实现高效的单步生成。具体而言，该模型既希望具备一步生成高质量样本的能力，又希望在必要时仍可通过增加采样步数来进一步提升生成质量，并继承扩散模型在零样本数据编辑任务中的灵活性</span></strong></p><ul list="u1c4bd433"><li fid="u36a1ad76" data-lake-id="u87d204ab" id="u87d204ab"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95e7b203" id="u95e7b203" style="color: #00346B">基于概率流常微分方程的建模思想</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u885d4aad" id="u885d4aad">：该方法建立在连续时间扩散模型的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ff1200c" id="u7ff1200c">概率流常微分方程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua264ab6d" id="ua264ab6d">之上。该 ODE 的轨迹能够将数据分布平滑地演化为易于处理的噪声分布。基于这一性质，作者提出学习一个映射函数，使其能够将任意时间步上的样本点映射回对应轨迹的起始点。该映射具有显著的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c7c1abe" id="u1c7c1abe">自一致性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2e27b4a2" id="u2e27b4a2">特征，即同一条轨迹上的不同点都应映射到同一个初始点，因此这类模型被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uae96ace1" id="uae96ace1">一致性模型</span></strong></li><li fid="u36a1ad76" data-lake-id="ub2dc9241" id="ub2dc9241"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7fdbddd7" id="u7fdbddd7">兼顾单步高效生成与多步质量提升</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc1643388" id="uc1643388">：一致性模型仅需一次网络前向传播，便可将随机噪声直接映射为数据样本，从而实现高效的单步生成。进一步地，通过在多个时间步上串联一致性模型的输出，还可以像扩散模型的迭代采样过程那样，以额外计算开销为代价换取更高的样本质量，并支持零样本数据编辑等任务</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u443e513f" id="u443e513f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A620.45458984375%2C%22height%22%3A226.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A970%2C%22originHeight%22%3A354%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4ff6dea2%22%7D" data-asset="assets/cee37c700bb0ae78b90eb58bb086b379.png"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u61823b09" id="u61823b09"><strong><span data-lake-id="u87964226" id="u87964226">为训练一致性模型，作者提出两种基于自一致性约束的方法</span></strong></p><ul list="u6912618b"><li fid="ua4872b40" data-lake-id="u7621802d" id="u7621802d"><span data-lake-id="u7937e4ad" id="u7937e4ad">第一种方法依赖数值 ODE 求解器和预训练扩散模型，在概率流 ODE 轨迹上构造相邻点对，并通过约束模型在这些相邻点上的输出保持一致，实现将扩散模型有效蒸馏为一致性模型</span></li><li fid="ua4872b40" data-lake-id="ub0a7328d" id="ub0a7328d"><span data-lake-id="u6278d1ea" id="u6278d1ea">第二种方法则摆脱对预训练扩散模型的依赖，使一致性模型可以作为一种独立的生成模型直接进行训练</span></li><li fid="ua4872b40" data-lake-id="u89b7087c" id="u89b7087c"><span data-lake-id="u29813f4f" id="u29813f4f">基于这两种训练范式，一致性模型不仅能够继承扩散模型蒸馏带来的高质量生成能力，也由此发展为一类独立的生成模型框架。值得注意的是，这两种方法均不需要对抗训练，且对模型结构的限制较少，因此能够灵活适配多种神经网络架构</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5d3487fe" id="u5d3487fe"><span data-lake-id="u855a1ba4" id="u855a1ba4">从方法效果上看，一致性模型在少步生成场景中展现出显著优势。作为蒸馏方法时，它能够实现高效的单步或少步采样；而作为独立生成模型训练时，即便不借助预训练扩散模型，也能够获得具有竞争力的生成性能。此外，一致性模型还具备良好的任务泛化能力，可广泛应用于多种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u25e6136f" id="u25e6136f">零样本数据编辑任务</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u973befe3" id="u973befe3">，包括图像去噪、插值、图像修补、图像上色、超分辨率重建以及基于笔画引导的图像编辑等</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="FLEJO" id="FLEJO"><span data-lake-id="u70bf60a2" id="u70bf60a2">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u2b9c7834" id="u2b9c7834"> </span><span data-lake-id="ufa8ca6a2" id="ufa8ca6a2">𝑫𝒊𝒇𝒇𝒖𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u89199cf8" id="u89199cf8"><span data-lake-id="u7447ad5a" id="u7447ad5a">一致性模型的提出，在理论上深受</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2ca665e" id="ud2ca665e">连续时间扩散模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6d333fc9" id="u6d333fc9">框架的启发。在这一框架中，扩散模型首先通过连续注入高斯噪声，将真实数据分布逐步扩散为更简单、更易处理的噪声分布；随后再通过相应的反向过程，从噪声中恢复出数据样本。设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VAAE5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41210292" id="u41210292">表示真实数据分布，则其前向扩散过程可由如下随机微分方程描述</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub2e10e56" id="ub2e10e56" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lPOab%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%20%3D%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cmu%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2C%20t)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7Dt%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma(t)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bd%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bw%7D_t%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8857077a"><li fid="u6afe8ec1" data-lake-id="u88e64528" id="u88e64528"><span data-lake-id="ude8a3bbc" id="ude8a3bbc">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vqbvQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue5ebb5d1" id="ue5ebb5d1">表示连续时间变量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hLVlz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%3E0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue4e387c8" id="ue4e387c8">为预先设定的终止时刻；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Yq3iv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1e0250a8" id="u1e0250a8">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bqjqr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf0633a00" id="uf0633a00">分别表示漂移系数与扩散系数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Wi9O2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Bw_t%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub153ae81" id="ub153ae81">表示标准布朗运动。将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22q53Zv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4361d230" id="u4361d230">的分布记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pRLj8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u43eb0d05" id="u43eb0d05">，因此有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jOq7j%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_0(x)%3Dp_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8c86aa28" id="u8c86aa28"><span data-lake-id="ua3f11804" id="ua3f11804">该 SDE 的一个重要性质在于：存在一个常微分方程，Song 等将其称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u81230718" id="u81230718">概率流 ODE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub072e483" id="ub072e483">，其解轨迹在任意时刻</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZvKJq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fb2fdeb" id="u8fb2fdeb">的边缘分布均服从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ce0J8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_t(x)%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud9757cdb" id="ud9757cdb" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tHxVB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22dx_t%3D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cmu(x_t%2Ct)-%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%5C%5Csigma(t)%5E2%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x_t)%5C%5Cright%5Ddt%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub1c73a87"><li fid="u1cd0e948" data-lake-id="u0d908659" id="u0d908659"><span data-lake-id="u68d5c43e" id="u68d5c43e">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JaScr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue97c7af0" id="ue97c7af0">是分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aQDVl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20p_t(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73186bd5" id="u73186bd5">的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4905a59f" id="u4905a59f">分数函数</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0c81ea6c" id="u0c81ea6c">；因此，扩散模型也常被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3c1f6b7" id="ue3c1f6b7">基于分数的生成模型</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50016dd8" id="u50016dd8">。通常，SDE 会被设计为使得</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YzP7F%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_T(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1519f7d3" id="u1519f7d3">接近某个易于处理的高斯分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cTDsb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf6c6212a" id="uf6c6212a">。后续采用 Karras 的设定，即令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hg2Yw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu(x%2Ct)%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u637bc5aa" id="u637bc5aa">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22EezJC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(t)%3D%5C%5Csqrt%7B2t%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3e3d85f3" id="u3e3d85f3">。在该情况下，有</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud9c98dc1" id="ud9c98dc1" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sW8Nk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_t(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%3D%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%5C%5Cotimes%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20t%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cpi(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7B0%7D%2C%20T%5E2%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7BI%7D)%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u9986353e"><li fid="uc1901f8c" data-lake-id="ubb05d362" id="ubb05d362"><span data-lake-id="ue0f116c8" id="ue0f116c8">在采样阶段，首先通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u073e0444" id="u073e0444">分数匹配</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1c275139" id="u1c275139">训练一个分数模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sfDes%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5f34a8c3" id="u5f34a8c3">，得到 PF ODE 的经验估计，其形式为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u73fa72ce" id="u73fa72ce" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22a1j3H%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdx_t%7D%7Bdt%7D%3D-t%5C%5C%2Cs_%5C%5Cphi(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u09cf9311"><li fid="u4ba90eea" data-lake-id="u302b8f4b" id="u302b8f4b"><span data-lake-id="u06abbb6b" id="u06abbb6b">上式被称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0a5c846b" id="u0a5c846b">经验概率流 ODE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ude699c76" id="ude699c76">。随后，从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22M53Jp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CT%5E2I)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc0aeaaa" id="ubc0aeaaa">中采样得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iuNmr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_T%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue6f10fb2" id="ue6f10fb2">作为经验 PF ODE 的初始值，并利用任意数值 ODE 求解器（如 Euler 求解器和 Heun 求解器）沿时间反向求解，得到解轨迹</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rxC1a%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7B%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5B0%2CT%5D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42f491f8" id="u42f491f8">。最终得到的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kSFpI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7753ad0a" id="u7753ad0a">可视为数据分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xReWh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue54dcb5d" id="ue54dcb5d">的近似样本。为避免数值不稳定性，通常不会将求解器真正积分到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YBayf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41a8eaa2" id="u41a8eaa2">，而是在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jnwxO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue851db0d" id="ue851db0d">处停止，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22r9sAG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub0f51524" id="ub0f51524">为一个固定的较小正数，并将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PHCy2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udbbc7442" id="udbbc7442">作为近似生成样本。按照 Karras 的设置，将图像像素值缩放到区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jo2yi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B-1%2C1%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u294e65da" id="u294e65da">，并设定</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CzcC4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22T%3D80%2C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cepsilon%3D0.002%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u29f47830" id="u29f47830"><span data-lake-id="ub6e888af" id="ub6e888af">扩散模型的一个主要瓶颈在于其</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c7ca8fa" id="u9c7ca8fa">采样速度较慢</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5562a355" id="u5562a355">。显然，利用 ODE 求解器进行采样需要对分数模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Unmaf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8527b68" id="uc8527b68">进行多次迭代评估，这会带来较高的计算开销。现有的快速采样方法主要包括两类：一类是设计更高效的数值 ODE 求解器，另一类是采用蒸馏技术。然而，即便采用改进的 ODE 求解器，通常仍需要超过 10 次函数评估，才能生成具有竞争力的样本。而大多数蒸馏方法都依赖于在蒸馏之前预先从扩散模型中生成一个大规模样本数据集，而这一过程本身就具有较高的计算成本</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="IfaXW" id="IfaXW"><span data-lake-id="u602f6e7a" id="u602f6e7a">🦥</span><span data-lake-id="u49e1b293" id="u49e1b293"> 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒚 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔</span></h2><p data-lake-id="udf5c5a40" id="udf5c5a40"><strong><span data-lake-id="u39ab8aca" id="u39ab8aca">作者提出一致性模型，这是一类在设计上原生支持单步生成的新型模型，同时仍允许通过迭代生成在样本质量与计算开销之间进行权衡，并支持零样本数据编辑。一致性模型可以通过两种模式进行训练，即蒸馏模式和独立训练模式</span></strong></p><ul list="ud7b4b8bd"><li fid="ud5ce6f09" data-lake-id="u469503d8" id="u469503d8"><span data-lake-id="u6e03ad27" id="u6e03ad27">在前一种模式下，一致性模型将预训练扩散模型中的知识蒸馏到一个单步采样器中，在样本质量方面显著优于其他蒸馏方法，同时仍可支持零样本图像编辑应用</span></li><li fid="ud5ce6f09" data-lake-id="u1ecce634" id="u1ecce634"><span data-lake-id="u1aa734e9" id="u1aa734e9">在后一种模式下，一致性模型则在不依赖任何预训练扩散模型的情况下独立训练，从而使其成为一类独立的新型生成模型</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u38b69c84" id="u38b69c84"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf5f72f4b" id="uf5f72f4b" style="color: #004347">一致性模型的定义：给定概率流 ODE 的一条解轨迹</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22L31M7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5C%5C%7Bx_t%5C%5C%7D_%7Bt%5C%5Cin%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2CT%5D%7D%7D%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fc4640f" id="u6fc4640f" style="color: #004347">，将一致性函数定义为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22QZizO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f%3A(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Cmapsto%20x_%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card></p><ul list="u44d673f7"><li fid="udb6e473e" data-lake-id="uce6bac6b" id="uce6bac6b"><span data-lake-id="ub6c1431d" id="ub6c1431d"></span><strong><span data-lake-id="u28f3e2e5" id="u28f3e2e5"></span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9c3cc82a" id="u9c3cc82a">对于属于同一条概率流 ODE 轨迹的任意一对</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OlCqC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(x_t%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u14a3917b" id="u14a3917b">，其输出应保持一致，即对任意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AkV1w%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%2Ct%27%5C%5Cin%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1249d2bb" id="u1249d2bb">，都有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wrW0B%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(x_t%2Ct)%3Df(x_%7Bt%27%7D%2Ct%27)%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="udb6e473e" data-lake-id="u8ab2bd61" id="u8ab2bd61"><span data-lake-id="uecd9aec7" id="uecd9aec7">一致性模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22d7I08%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67122c2c" id="u67122c2c">的目标是通过数据学习来逼近上述一致性函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hPDak%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7b302bd" id="ud7b302bd">，其核心在于学习并显式施加这种自一致性约束</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u783150f4" id="u783150f4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A460.727294921875%2C%22height%22%3A210.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A683%2C%22originHeight%22%3A312%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8906290f%22%7D" data-asset="assets/5077dc7381b8b58d1325f842df24617b.png"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u145f78e0" id="u145f78e0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22c93ea4" id="u22c93ea4" style="color: #004347">一致性模型的参数化：对于任意一致性函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LyZvK%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2faf09f4" id="u2faf09f4" style="color: #004347">，都有</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22PwPMp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(x_%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%5C%5Cepsilon)%3Dx_%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udba1e3fe" id="udba1e3fe" style="color: #004347">即当时间取边界值</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fYQQd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u8858ea53" id="u8858ea53" style="color: #004347">时，函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22awXyh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Cepsilon)%20%22%7D" style="color: #004347"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uaee3738e" id="uaee3738e" style="color: #004347">应当退化为恒等映射</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua60d2eaa" id="ua60d2eaa">。将这一约束称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9bec52de" id="u9bec52de">边界条件</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uaa87de0c" id="uaa87de0c">。所有一致性模型都必须满足该边界条件，因为它在一致性模型的成功训练中起着关键作用。同时，这一边界条件也是一致性模型在架构层面最主要、最本质的约束</span></p><p data-lake-id="u31541f6e" id="u31541f6e"><span data-lake-id="u47996f2d" id="u47996f2d">对于基于深度神经网络构建的一致性模型，作者讨论两种几乎无需额外代价即可实现该边界条件的参数化方式。设</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cjJ7s%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u791c8595" id="u791c8595">是一个自由形式的深度神经网络，其输出维度与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NxrrE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42abb3aa" id="u42abb3aa">相同。第一种方式是直接将一致性模型参数化为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue562c3e9" id="ue562c3e9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kD2EN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20x%2C%20%26%20t%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%20F_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%2C%20%26%20t%5C%5Cin(%5C%5Cepsilon%2CT%5D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u392248af" id="u392248af"><span data-lake-id="u9b0ef4ed" id="u9b0ef4ed">第二种方式则利用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u877c756a" id="u877c756a">跳跃连接</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u55b08584" id="u55b08584">进行参数化，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WpOMF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8da716d6" id="u8da716d6">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fgwk9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0058244c" id="u0058244c">是可微函数，并满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22giXe9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon)%3D1%2Cc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(%5C%5Cepsilon)%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8278bef2" id="u8278bef2">。在这种参数化方式下，只要</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Yj7Za%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22F_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u38232122" id="u38232122">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AFRJk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57d17fab" id="u57d17fab">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZmLrl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub591a890" id="ub591a890">都是可微的，则一致性模型在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22MP3NO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2c17e18f" id="u2c17e18f">处也是可微的，而这一点对于连续时间一致性模型的训练至关重要</span></p><p data-lake-id="u26fa655b" id="u26fa655b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GqFhk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%3Dc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bskip%7D%7D(t)x%2Bc_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bout%7D%7D(t)F_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ued9030a7" id="ued9030a7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AKdRw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22c_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bskip%7D%7D(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%5E2%7D%7B(t%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%5E2%20%2B%20%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%5E2%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20c_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bout%7D%7D(t)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D(t%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon)%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Csigma_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%5E2%20%2B%20t%5E2%7D%7D%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud983ec12" id="ud983ec12"><strong><span data-lake-id="u84c3f14d" id="u84c3f14d" style="color: #101E60">一致性模型的采样：在获得训练良好的一致性模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wMMfp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uab3f24bd" id="uab3f24bd" style="color: #101E60">后，可以首先从初始分布中采样</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VsUIL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_T%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(0%2CT%5E2I)%2C%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubf7e53a0" id="ubf7e53a0" style="color: #101E60">然后通过一次一致性模型评估得到</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22j3Pec%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_%5C%5Cepsilon%3Df_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D_T%2CT).%22%7D" style="color: #101E60"></card><span data-lake-id="uc484d792" id="uc484d792">这一过程仅涉及一次前向传播，因此可以实现</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6c028aa5" id="u6c028aa5">单步采样生成</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9ef4bc58" id="u9ef4bc58">。更重要的是，一致性模型也可以通过交替执行</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u95403548" id="u95403548">去噪</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udb22a5c0" id="udb22a5c0">与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7d7970ed" id="u7d7970ed">噪声注入</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u53a50975" id="u53a50975">步骤，多次调用一致性模型，从而进一步提升样本质量</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud84e816d" id="ud84e816d"><span data-lake-id="u1827fa3b" id="u1827fa3b">算法 1 对这种</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ff03951" id="u7ff03951">多步采样过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9b9912b8" id="u9b9912b8">进行总结。该过程赋予模型一种灵活机制，使其能够在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf15bb6c8" id="uf15bb6c8">计算开销与样本质量之间进行权衡</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u16458ed8" id="u16458ed8">。在实际实现中，作者使用贪心算法来确定算法 1 中的时间点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VTNA1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau_1%2C%5C%5Ctau_2%2C%5C%5Cldots%2C%5C%5Ctau_%7BN-1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u318470c7" id="u318470c7">。具体而言，这些时间点是逐个选取的，并通过三分搜索来优化由算法 1 所生成样本的 FID</span></p><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="cm-algorithm-1">
<figcaption id="cm-algorithm-1"><strong>Algorithm 1</strong> Multistep Consistency Sampling</figcaption>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{l}
\textbf{Input: }\text{Consistency model }f_\theta(\cdot,\cdot),\text{ sequence of time points }\tau_1&gt;\tau_2&gt;\cdots&gt;\tau_{N-1},\text{ initial noise }\hat{\mathbf x}_T\\[-0.2em]
\mathbf x\leftarrow f_\theta(\hat{\mathbf x}_T,T)\\[-0.2em]
\textbf{for }n=1\textbf{ to }N-1\textbf{ do}\\[-0.2em]
\quad\text{Sample }\mathbf z\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,\mathbf I)\\[-0.2em]
\quad\hat{\mathbf x}_{\tau_n}\leftarrow\mathbf x+\sqrt{\tau_n^2-\epsilon^2}\,\mathbf z\\[-0.2em]
\quad\mathbf x\leftarrow f_\theta(\hat{\mathbf x}_{\tau_n},\tau_n)\\[-0.2em]
\textbf{end for}\\[-0.2em]
\textbf{Output: }\mathbf x
\end{array}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-142%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Bl%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7BInput%3A%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7BConsistency%20model%20%7Df_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%2C%5C%5Ctext%7B%20sequence%20of%20time%20points%20%7D%5C%5Ctau_1%3E%5C%5Ctau_2%3E%5C%5Ccdots%3E%5C%5Ctau_%7BN-1%7D%2C%5C%5Ctext%7B%20initial%20noise%20%7D%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_T%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%5C%5Cleftarrow%20f_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_T%2CT)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Dn%3D1%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20to%20%7DN-1%5C%5Ctextbf%7B%20do%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BSample%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf0%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctau_n%7D%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%2B%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Ctau_n%5E2-%5C%5Cepsilon%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%20z%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%5C%5Cleftarrow%20f_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctau_n%7D%2C%5C%5Ctau_n)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7BOutput%3A%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</figure></section><h2 data-lake-id="ZacXI" id="ZacXI"><span data-lake-id="u76e79875" id="u76e79875">🐳</span><span data-lake-id="u6fa29ae5" id="u6fa29ae5"> 𝑻𝒓𝒂𝒊𝒏𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒚 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒗𝒊𝒂 𝑫𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒊𝒍𝒍𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="udfab126d" id="udfab126d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b7713d9" id="u2b7713d9">首先介绍第一种一致性模型训练方法，即基于对预训练分数模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FgIPL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ucb6ae72f" id="ucb6ae72f">进行蒸馏的训练方式。讨论围绕经验概率流 ODE 展开，该方程是将分数模型</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uRDI5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u4469e7a7" id="u4469e7a7">代入概率流 ODE 后得到的</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf10c86e2" id="uf10c86e2"></span></p><p data-lake-id="u132e93c8" id="u132e93c8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pm1xh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7Bdx_t%7D%7Bdt%7D%3D-t%5C%5C%2Cs_%5C%5Cphi(x_t%2Ct)%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5a98e8a1" id="u5a98e8a1"><span data-lake-id="u661072d2" id="u661072d2">考虑将时间区间</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22x0imB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%20T%5D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc1b57196" id="uc1b57196">离散为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cWVr1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N-1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5be92d9a" id="u5be92d9a">个子区间，其边界点满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rHtx8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_1%3D%5C%5Cepsilon%20%3C%20t_2%20%3C%20%5C%5Ccdots%20%3C%20t_N%3DT.%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u60fc7863" id="u60fc7863">在实际实现中，遵循 Karras 的设定，按照如下公式确定这些时间边界</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0076d814" id="u0076d814" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GikXD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B1%2F%5C%5Crho%7D%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7Bi-1%7D%7BN-1%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20T%5E%7B1%2F%5C%5Crho%7D%20-%20%5C%5Cepsilon%5E%7B1%2F%5C%5Crho%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%5C%5Crho%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Crho%20%3D%207%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u43bca424" id="u43bca424"><span data-lake-id="uc1a887a4" id="uc1a887a4">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eIo2L%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf9de1855" id="uf9de1855">足够大时，可以通过数值 ODE 求解器执行一步离散更新，从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ACFmc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u390822bd" id="u390822bd">得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Nze6N%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_n%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud0a22dab" id="ud0a22dab">的准确近似。将该估计记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22e32YF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub6985a57" id="ub6985a57">，并定义为</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7c273811" id="u7c273811" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22k7S3d%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%3A%3Dx_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2B(t_n-t_%7Bn%2B1%7D)%5C%5CPhi(x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D%3B%5C%5Cphi)%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue4f56a0d" id="ue4f56a0d"><span data-lake-id="u3c99902f" id="u3c99902f">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oVpso%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Cphi)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u88764cc7" id="u88764cc7">表示应用于经验 PF ODE 的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1d4e6931" id="u1d4e6931">单步 ODE 求解器</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u16f2133f" id="u16f2133f">的更新函数。例如，当采用 Euler 求解器时，有</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zsmyo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi(x%2Ct%3B%5C%5Cphi)%3D-t%5C%5C%2Cs_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%2C%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0680b848" id="u0680b848">相应地，其更新规则为</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue10b188e" id="ue10b188e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ZzyJD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%3Dx_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D-(t_n-t_%7Bn%2B1%7D)t_%7Bn%2B1%7Ds_%5C%5Cphi(x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D)%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u4c318992" id="u4c318992"><strong><span data-lake-id="uec260635" id="uec260635" style="color: #101E60">由于概率流 ODE 与 SDE 之间存在对应关系，可以通过以下方式对 ODE 轨迹上的分布进行采样：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3bf9c558" id="u3bf9c558">首先从真实数据分布中采样</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pmRFE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20x%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64466d41" id="u64466d41">，然后向其加入高斯噪声。具体而言，给定一个数据点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22g34DL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf2c725b" id="ubf2c725b">，可先从 SDE 的转移分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22i06ek%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5E2I)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uaff82936" id="uaff82936">中采样得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xMGWN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u572bb4ef" id="u572bb4ef">，再通过数值 ODE 求解器执行一步离散更新，计算得到</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pHENs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4eec2f0" id="uc4eec2f0">。由此，便可高效生成概率流 ODE 轨迹上一对相邻点</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CVIkf%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22(%5C%5Chat%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Cphi%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%2Cx_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u18efed4e" id="u18efed4e">。随后，通过最小化一致性模型在这对点上的输出差异来进行训练。这一思想引出如下的一致性蒸馏损失</span></p><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><div class="lake-derivation" style="--derivation-border:#a597c6;--derivation-background:#f8f5fc">
<p class="lake-derivation-title">一致性蒸馏通过约束相邻轨迹点的预测一致来训练模型</p>
<div class="lake-derivation-body">
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathcal L_{\mathrm{CD}}^N(\theta,\theta^-;\phi)
=\mathbb E\!\left[\lambda(t_n)d\!\left(f_\theta(x_{t_{n+1}},t_{n+1}),f_{\theta^-}(\hat x^\phi_{t_n},t_n)\right)\right]\tag{12}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-143%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCD%7D%7D%5EN(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3B%5C%5Cphi)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%20E%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clambda(t_n)d%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(f_%5C%5Ctheta(x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D)%2Cf_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%7D(%5C%5Chat%20x%5E%5C%5Cphi_%7Bt_n%7D%2Ct_n)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>期望对 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-144%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-145%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%5C%5Csim%5C%5Coperatorname%7BUniform%7D%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CN-1%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card> 和 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-146%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(x%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5E2I)%22%7D"></card> 计算，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-147%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%20x%5E%5C%5Cphi_%7Bt_n%7D%22%7D"></card> 由式（10）得到</li>
<li><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-148%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(t_n)%3E0%22%7D"></card> 为权重，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-149%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%22%7D"></card> 为目标网络参数；距离函数满足 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-150%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d(x%2Cy)%5C%5Cgeq0%22%7D"></card>，且仅当 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-151%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%3Dy%22%7D"></card> 时取 0</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></section><p data-lake-id="u1cd990c4" id="u1cd990c4"><span data-lake-id="u6c269e21" id="u6c269e21">作者考虑三种距离度量：平方</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22mciO1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell_2%20%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ued200b2c" id="ued200b2c">距离</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22O863u%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5C%7Cx-y%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud9c0c7cc" id="ud9c0c7cc">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lyDpD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell_1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue906647e" id="ue906647e">距离</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22njS1A%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d(x%2Cy)%3D%5C%5C%7Cx-y%5C%5C%7C_1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u95d8efc0" id="u95d8efc0">，以及感知相似性指标 LPIPS。实验结果表明，在所有任务和数据集上，取</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zUZKl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Clambda(t_n)%5C%5Cequiv%201%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud50194f6" id="ud50194f6">都能够取得良好效果。在实际训练中，作者通过随机梯度下降优化模型参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nYRKq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f853815" id="u4f853815">，同时利用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f24646f" id="u2f24646f">指数滑动平均</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue85afee1" id="ue85afee1">（EMA）更新</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Lu4XA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua3caecea" id="ua3caecea">。具体而言，给定衰减率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22AXE8e%22%2C%22code%22%3A%220%5C%5Cle%20%5C%5Cmu%20%3C1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0fde82d3" id="u0fde82d3">，在每一步优化之后执行如下更新</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud2619307" id="ud2619307" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22K8zSD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-%20%5C%5Cleftarrow%20%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bstopgrad%7D(%5C%5Cmu%20%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%5E-%20%2B%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cmu)%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D)%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%7D"></card></p><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="cm-algorithm-2">
<figcaption id="cm-algorithm-2"><strong>Algorithm 2</strong> Consistency Distillation (CD)</figcaption>
<p><strong>Input:</strong> dataset <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-152%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20D%22%7D"></card>, initial model parameter <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-153%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card>, learning rate <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-154%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ceta%22%7D"></card>, ODE solver <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-155%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPhi(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Cphi)%22%7D"></card>, <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-156%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card>, <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-157%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card>, and <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-158%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu%22%7D"></card></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{l}
\theta^-\leftarrow\theta\\[-0.2em]
\textbf{repeat}\\[-0.2em]
\quad\text{Sample }\mathbf x\sim\mathcal D\text{ and }n\sim\mathcal U[\![1,N-1]\!]\\[-0.2em]
\quad\text{Sample }\mathbf x_{t_{n+1}}\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf x;t_{n+1}^2\mathbf I)\\[-0.2em]
\quad\hat{\mathbf x}_{t_n}^\phi\leftarrow\mathbf x_{t_{n+1}}+(t_n-t_{n+1})\Phi(\mathbf x_{t_{n+1}},t_{n+1};\phi)\\[-0.2em]
\quad\mathcal L(\theta,\theta^-;\phi)\leftarrow\lambda(t_n)\,d\!\left(f_\theta(\mathbf x_{t_{n+1}},t_{n+1}),f_{\theta^-}(\hat{\mathbf x}_{t_n}^\phi,t_n)\right)\\[-0.2em]
\quad\theta\leftarrow\theta-\eta\nabla_\theta\mathcal L(\theta,\theta^-;\phi)\\[-0.2em]
\quad\theta^-\leftarrow\operatorname{stopgrad}\!\left(\mu\theta^-+(1-\mu)\theta\right)\\[-0.2em]
\textbf{until }\text{convergence}
\end{array}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-159%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Bl%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Brepeat%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BSample%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20D%5C%5Ctext%7B%20and%20%7Dn%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20U%5B%5C%5C!%5B1%2CN-1%5D%5C%5C!%5D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BSample%20%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%3Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%5E2%5C%5Cmathbf%20I)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%5E%5C%5Cphi%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2B(t_n-t_%7Bn%2B1%7D)%5C%5CPhi(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D%3B%5C%5Cphi)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Cmathcal%20L(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3B%5C%5Cphi)%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Clambda(t_n)%5C%5C%2Cd%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(f_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Cmathbf%20x_%7Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7D%7D%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D)%2Cf_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%7D(%5C%5Chat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%20x%7D_%7Bt_n%7D%5E%5C%5Cphi%2Ct_n)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Ctheta-%5C%5Ceta%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%20L(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3B%5C%5Cphi)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%5C%5Cleftarrow%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstopgrad%7D%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cmu%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%2B(1-%5C%5Cmu)%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cright)%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.2em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Buntil%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7Bconvergence%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</figure></section><p data-lake-id="ufb9fcdd3" id="ufb9fcdd3"><span data-lake-id="u88a0476f" id="u88a0476f">作者将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Mp3Y4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u00d4999f" id="u00d4999f">称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c638582" id="u0c638582">目标网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9608b413" id="u9608b413">，将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hLaLC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%20f_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubce81b64" id="ubce81b64">称为</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u23c4bf40" id="u23c4bf40">在线网络</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufea1b265" id="ufea1b265">。实验中发现，相较于直接令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22pyzw6%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3D%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u156df882" id="u156df882">，EMA 更新和 stopgrad 操作能够显著稳定训练过程，并提升一致性模型的最终性能。下面，作者基于渐近分析给出一致性蒸馏的理论解释</span></p><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><div class="lake-derivation" style="--derivation-border:#94adc8;--derivation-background:#fffcf5">
<p class="lake-derivation-title">定理 1：一致性蒸馏的误差界</p>
<div class="lake-derivation-body">
<p>记 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-160%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%20t%3D%5C%5Cmax_%7B1%5C%5Cleq%20n%3CN%7D%7Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D-t_n%7C%22%7D"></card>，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-161%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot%3B%5C%5Cphi)%22%7D"></card> 为式（8）所定义经验概率流 ODE 的一致性函数</p>
<ul>
<li>假设 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-162%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f_%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card> 对输入满足一致的 Lipschitz 条件：存在 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-163%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L%3E0%22%7D"></card>，使任意 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-164%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-165%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card> 和 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-166%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22y%22%7D"></card> 均满足 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-167%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5C%7Cf_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct)-f_%5C%5Ctheta(y%2Ct)%5C%5C%7C_2%5C%5Cleq%20L%5C%5C%7Cx-y%5C%5C%7C_2%22%7D"></card></li>
<li>假设 ODE 求解器在每个区间上的局部误差一致有界于 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-168%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O((t_%7Bn%2B1%7D-t_n)%5E%7Bp%2B1%7D)%22%7D"></card>，其中 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-169%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p%5C%5Cgeq1%22%7D"></card>；若 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-170%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCD%7D%7D%5EN(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Ctheta%3B%5C%5Cphi)%3D0%22%7D"></card>，则有</li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\sup_{n,x}\|f_\theta(x,t_n)-f(x,t_n;\phi)\|_2=O((\Delta t)^p)\tag{14}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-171%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csup_%7Bn%2Cx%7D%5C%5C%7Cf_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Ct_n)-f(x%2Ct_n%3B%5C%5Cphi)%5C%5C%7C_2%3DO((%5C%5CDelta%20t)%5Ep)%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
</div>
</div></section><h2 data-lake-id="f2cD1" id="f2cD1"><span data-lake-id="u10d26868" id="u10d26868">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u4790db97" id="u4790db97"> 𝑻𝒓𝒂𝒊𝒏𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒔𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒚 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔 𝒊𝒏 𝑰𝒔𝒐𝒍𝒂𝒕𝒊𝒐𝒏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8a43648e" id="u8a43648e"><span data-lake-id="u3ce62721" id="u3ce62721">一致性模型的训练并不一定依赖于预训练扩散模型。这一点不同于现有的大多数扩散蒸馏方法，也正因此，使得一致性模型不仅是一种蒸馏框架，更成为一类</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue8240126" id="ue8240126">独立的生成模型家族</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u954eacae" id="u954eacae">。回顾一致性蒸馏方法可知，该方法依赖于一个预训练分数模型</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rIknw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u005e553a" id="u005e553a">来逼近真实分数函数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ScbM8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud4dc8e22" id="ud4dc8e22">。然而，作者指出，实际上可以完全摆脱这一预训练分数模型，而改为利用如下</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u28e8e0b7" id="u28e8e0b7">无偏估计量</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u920bfad6" id="u920bfad6"></span></p><p data-lake-id="ub3a00cad" id="ub3a00cad" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YmnTk%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x_t)%20%3D%20-%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-x%7D%7Bt%5E2%7D%5C%5C%2C%5C%5Cmiddle%7C%5C%5C%2Cx_t%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u71f2697d"><li fid="u9aa64624" data-lake-id="ub0be2ae7" id="ub0be2ae7"><span data-lake-id="u31e2b5b6" id="u31e2b5b6">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22M5sLe%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u13aa1636" id="u13aa1636">且</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tFEux%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BN%7D(x%2Ct%5E2I).%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0c301849" id="u0c301849">数据样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lUtTH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42e9fa53" id="u42e9fa53">在给定噪声样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KSDMz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x_t%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua2cd4998" id="ua2cd4998">的后验条件分布下仍具有随机性；</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yQYKp%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22-%5C%5Cfrac%7Bx_t-x%7D%7Bt%5E2%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8f4476c7" id="u8f4476c7">是</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qQzcN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla%20%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x_t)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u660eea26" id="u660eea26">的条件无偏估计。作者进一步表明，在采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1247b1ab" id="u1247b1ab">Euler 方法</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3c74c07b" id="u3c74c07b"> 作为 ODE 求解器、并考虑</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22g99Pc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N%5C%5Cto%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u50b5b26a" id="u50b5b26a">的极限情形时，这一无偏估计足以替代一致性蒸馏中原本所需的预训练扩散模型</span></li></ul><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><div class="lake-derivation" style="--derivation-border:#98b9ac;--derivation-background:#fffcf5">
<p class="lake-derivation-title">定理 2：一致性训练与蒸馏的渐近关系</p>
<div class="lake-derivation-body">
<p>沿用 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-172%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CDelta%20t%3D%5C%5Cmax_%7B1%5C%5Cleq%20n%3CN%7D%7Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D-t_n%7C%22%7D"></card>，在下列条件下，一致性训练损失与蒸馏损失具有渐近关系</p>
<ul>
<li><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-173%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%22%7D"></card> 与 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-174%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22f_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%7D%22%7D"></card> 二阶连续可微且二阶导数有界，<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-175%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda%22%7D"></card> 有界，并满足 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-176%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%20E%5B%5C%5C%7C%5C%5Cnabla%5C%5Clog%20p_%7Bt_n%7D(x_%7Bt_n%7D)%5C%5C%7C_2%5E2%5D%3C%5C%5Cinfty%22%7D"></card></li>
<li>采用 Euler 求解器，且对所有 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-177%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%5C%5Cin%5B%5C%5Cepsilon%2CT%5D%22%7D"></card>，分数模型精确满足 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-178%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22s_%5C%5Cphi(x%2Ct)%3D%5C%5Cnabla%5C%5Clog%20p_t(x)%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathcal L_{\mathrm{CD}}^N(\theta,\theta^-;\phi)
=\mathcal L_{\mathrm{CT}}^N(\theta,\theta^-)+o(\Delta t)\tag{16}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-179%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCD%7D%7D%5EN(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%3B%5C%5Cphi)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCT%7D%7D%5EN(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Ctheta%5E-)%2Bo(%5C%5CDelta%20t)%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<p>其中，一致性训练目标定义为</p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\mathcal L_{\mathrm{CT}}^N(\theta,\theta^-)
=\mathbb E\!\left[\lambda(t_n)d\!\left(f_\theta(x+t_{n+1}z,t_{n+1}),f_{\theta^-}(x+t_nz,t_n)\right)\right]\tag{17}
"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-180%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20L_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BCT%7D%7D%5EN(%5C%5Ctheta%2C%5C%5Ctheta%5E-)%5Cn%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%20E%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Clambda(t_n)d%5C%5C!%5C%5Cleft(f_%5C%5Ctheta(x%2Bt_%7Bn%2B1%7Dz%2Ct_%7Bn%2B1%7D)%2Cf_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%5E-%7D(x%2Bt_nz%2Ct_n)%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%5Cn%22%7D"></card></div>
<ul>
<li>期望对 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-181%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22x%5C%5Csim%20p_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bdata%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>、<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-182%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n%5C%5Csim%5C%5Coperatorname%7BUniform%7D%5C%5C%7B1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2CN-1%5C%5C%7D%22%7D"></card> 和 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-183%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22z%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%20N(0%2CI)%22%7D"></card> 计算，两侧加噪输入使用同一个噪声样本 <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-184%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22z%22%7D"></card></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div></section><section class="lake-revised-section lake-appendix"><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="cm-algorithm-3">
<figcaption id="cm-algorithm-3"><strong>Algorithm 3</strong> Consistency Training (CT)</figcaption>
<p><strong>Input:</strong> dataset <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-185%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%20D%22%7D"></card>, initial model parameter <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-186%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%7D"></card>, learning rate <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-187%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ceta%22%7D"></card>, step schedule <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-188%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card>, EMA decay rate schedule <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-189%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card>, <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-190%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d(%5C%5Ccdot%2C%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card>, and <card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22generated-genai-191%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%7D"></card></p>
<div class="equation" tabindex="0" role="math" aria-label="\begin{array}{l}
\theta^-\leftarrow\theta\text{ and }k\leftarrow0\\[-0.2em]
\textbf{repeat}\\[-0.2em]
\quad\text{Sample }\mathbf x\sim\mathcal D,\text{ and }n\sim\mathcal U[\![1,N(k)-1]\!]\\[-0.2em]
\quad\text{Sample }\mathbf z\sim\mathcal N(\mathbf0,\mathbf I)\\[-0.2em]
\quad\mathcal L(\theta,\theta^-)\leftarrow\lambda(t_n)\,d\!\left(f_\theta(\mathbf x+t_{n+1}\mathbf z,t_{n+1}),f_{\theta^-}(\mathbf x+t_n\mathbf z,t_n)\right)\\[-0.2em]
\quad\theta\leftarrow\theta-\eta\nabla_\theta\mathcal L(\theta,\theta^-)\\[-0.2em]
\quad\theta^-\leftarrow\operatorname{stopgrad}\!\left(\mu(k)\theta^-+(1-\mu(k))\theta\right)\\[-0.2em]
\quad k\leftarrow k+1\\[-0.2em]
\textbf{until }\text{convergence}
\end{array}
